<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">-Yemsa New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Yohannis</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yohannisni Misirachchuni Kaama</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohannis</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoha.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohannis Tichina</para>
  <para style="mt2">Daamni Yesus Kiristoosni Misirachchuni Kaama</para>
  <para style="imt1">Gachgiru</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohannis tichina Misirachchuni kaamaassi Yesusnin chowaason besunak sholenaas asha mayye asuni meeni ganesi beste hayewa Ha'oni kaama sinbaason ammanon besukwa. Matsafaas teetbaasik makefanaas han misirachchuni kaamaason feretife baasso Yesus fatunir sinne yoonir yiste Ha'oni Naa sinbaason amanosoneknawa barik amanosobesiisik koi'ba foonto kaa danosonematona yaadatosonekwa. (20:31).</para>
  <para style="ip">Misirachchuni kaamaasi tesuni dimaas koi'ba foonto Ha'oosi kaamnewa Yesusna isar sinobesiison gachgiru zagire besi. (Eddeba 1:1-18) Estan Yesus fatunir sinne yoonir yiste Ha'oni naa sinbaason besifa showo tesa biistera artonoy wuzasikitonontu makefa. (Eddeba 1:19—12:50) Estan es biistera artonoy wuzaasikitosin aro buu'a bestenamato besifa tochooson tusira makefa. Es tesuni dimaas makefanaas isa isa asuni meya Yesusnik amanesere basa zoonsi sinobesiison; oomni meya dey aakkak tugga'setematonawa barik aafa amanoniwuza yisetematonawa. (Eddeba 13-17) Yesus oottena wono waalin nawoni meyaneen awune fa tai'so isarbesi faanamato suuttona wonaasik hoossuni kaamnewa chinuni kaamne baassok makenamatotu makefa. Koi'ni eddeesikito Yesusni oottosonnawa mangsu katonak ta'baasonna; basa suuttosonnawa kitun kabubaasonna; esiisimato dey kitun kabinanneen orfo nawoni meyak ammanon bestobaasontu makefa. (Eddeba 18-21).</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohannis Yesus Kiristoosniki kamo bestefa koi'ba foonto kaason teggira besifa es Ha'oosi otma hawungneen kabira Yesusnin ugna zagire; futo zagire; kaa zagire ephpheteesefe baassokwa. Yohannisni misirachchuni kaamaason ooma zagifaas ayyanak foosi futonon assuk arto wonna wonnati foosik ephpha ke'feni wuzasikitonon; esiis dey aka, tusha, chaarefa, keemer, fantunikito, wayinini tokonewa wayinini gaanane fa wuzasikitonon beso zagire ephphe ke'baaswa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Matsafaasi Siruk Ephna Ephobaas</para>
  <para style="io1">Gachgiru; <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 1:1-18">1:1-18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Haphqife Yohannisnawa Yesusni tesuni nawoni meena <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-51">1:19-51</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesus ammanon wosto jammarobaas <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 2:1-12:50">2:1—12:50</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yerusalemniissinawa biratobaastaki wostobaasi koi'ni wonaasikitona <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 13:1-19:42">13:1—19:42</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Daamiisa kitun kabunewa ammanon bestobaase <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 20:1-31">20:1-31</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Koor'ubaas: Galiilak hepsa nawoni meyak ammanon bestobaas <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 21:1-25">21:1-25</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Yohannis Tichina Ha'oni Kaani Kaama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>Zeemmaneen kaam feer. Bar dey Ha'ooskitu fe; Kaamiis dey Ha'o; <verse eid="JHN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>Bar dey zeemme Ha'oosneentu fe. <verse eid="JHN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/>Zuuttambaase bariktu teste; teste wuzaas zuuttera barki kamotu teste; isa wuzane barneen gerakalo tester aafa. <verse eid="JHN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/>Kaa barki faar; es kaas dey asunik chaarefa sinna faar. <verse eid="JHN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/>Chaarefaas talmaassi chaarsir; talmaas baron aane merowa.<verse eid="JHN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>Ha'ooskin wostere ye sumba Yohannis yiste isa asu feer. <verse eid="JHN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>Zuuttambesiise barki kamo amanosonek bar chaarefaasi chowanon zaala makonaktu ye. <verse eid="JHN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>Chaarefaasi chowanon zaala makonaktu yeeteno bar chaarefte.<verse eid="JHN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>Asu zuuttambaase asik chaarsuni futoni chaarefa han daasta yaadifar. <verse eid="JHN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>Han daasta feer; han daas bariktu teste; sinfanaknu han daas aane ephphatowa. <verse eid="JHN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>Basa keen sina baassoki ye; sinuntano baasso barin aane ephphetoosoto. <verse eid="JHN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Sinuntano ephpheteesere sunbaasik amanefe baasso zuuttere Ha'oni naanggota sinonek mabti imi. <verse eid="JHN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/>Baasso Ha'oni naanggota sinetees asuni tumak wedey hannakin wedey ashakin wedey teegoni fiqadik aane koontosoto. Baasso koontesetees Ha'okingwa.<verse eid="JHN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>Kaamiis asha sinne inno ganeyaassi ha'i. Inno dey Ababaaski feena kabaasik fa ulfinbaasne fa isa naa bar basa ulfinaason biini. Bar dey [Ha'oni otumaknawa futokna tuum]. <verse eid="JHN 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>Yohannis basa chowaason zaala maket: « ‹Ta orfoosta yooni bar taneen sinak feer. Tayistan dey denalo› yira makenaas barwa» yire chaagi. <verse eid="JHN 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>Basa tumaastan inno zuuttamniise otmaasta otma daysira ephphataani. <verse eid="JHN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>Tumaas Museniki kamo imte. Sinuntano otumnewa futone Yesus Kiristoosniki kamo ya. <verse eid="JHN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>Ha'ooson biyar oonu aafe. Sinuntano abani sina Ha'oosneen fe isa naas bar bar Ha'oos oo sinnamato innok ammanon besi.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Haphqife Yohannis Makena Zaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>Ayhudni meeni ha'sinynyani meya Yerusalemun maagni meenawa baassotin argassefe Lewini meena asin Yohannisniki wosisere: «Ne oonso?» yire mamussisete kabaasik makena zaalni kaamaas haniiswa. <verse eid="JHN 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>Bar dey aachunoy: «Yoonir yiste muudtos tatewa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muudtos uus Mesi wedey Kiristoos.</char></note>» yire ammanon make. <verse eid="JHN 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>Baasso dey: «Eekin ne oonso? Eliyasnoso?» yire mamussete. Bar dey: «Indaanewa» yire wolgi. Baasso dey: «Eekin raajjunoso?» yisete. Bar dey: «Indaanewa» yire wolgi. <verse eid="JHN 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>Baasso dey: «Eekin ne oonso? Innotin wosi baassok hamma makonik ne teetaason oo yifasso?» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/>Bar: «Raajju Isayyasniissi maktenaasimato ‹Daamiisa ugnanon zeep'ti› yire ichma daassi chaagfe asusa kaamatawa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>Baasso wostere yeesetees Ferisawini meyakin. <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>Baasso dey Yohannisnin: «Ese ne Kiristoos wedey Eeliyas wedey yoonir yiste raajjuus sina shakaatane awuniron haphqidifa?» yisere mamussete. <verse eid="JHN 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>Yohannis wolgire: «Ta akaktu haphquna. Sinuntano nitto arunoytir ganentiissi yereferwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>Ta orfoosta yooni basa chaa'maasi taar'anon kotak sholsunoynar barwa.» <verse eid="JHN 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>Han bar zuuttera sinnaas Yohannis haphqit feena Yordanosni akaasi yesalo awa kesnarki fa Bitaniyaktu sini.<verse eid="JHN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ha'oni Fantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Wonotirik Yesus Yohannisniki yeefeen biyaat ekka yi: «Ese han daasta fe asusa boor'anon baassostan tishkuni Ha'oni fantu <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>‹Ta orfoosta yooni bar taneen sinak feer. Tayistan dey denalo› yira makenaas barwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>Tanu es yooni barin aane arifatwa. Sinuntano ta akak haphqit yaanaas Israelni meyak barin arsonekwa.» <verse eid="JHN 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>Yohannis ekka yire zaala make: «Korto Ayyana saman nakalone faar sinna basaasta kerefeen biin. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>Akak haphqunak taan wosi bar: ‹Korto Ayyana kerefeennawa basaasta diifeenna biyata bartu Korto Ayyanak haphquniiswa› yira makena kabaneen tanu aane arutwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>Ta dey biina boor'a bar Ha'oni naa sinbaason zaala makefan.»<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tesuni Yesusni Nawoosakito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Wonotirik Yohannis hep nawobaasneen esta yerefer. <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>Yesus estak aatfeen Yohannis biyaat: «Ese haniis Ha'oosi fantuwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>Hep Yohannisni nawoosakito Yohannis es baron makefeen odesefaat Yesusni orfoose hamete. <verse eid="JHN 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Baasso Yesusni orfoose hamefeen yerqere biyaat «Awu sholedifetirinso?» yi. Baasso dey: «Rebi! Ayinso faafatari?» yisete. (Rebi! Uus assinynya uu.) <verse eid="JHN 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>Bar dey: «Yaara biitiwa» yi. Hamere feefenamato biyere Es wono ane feeshete. Es kabaasik dey wonni asir sa'ati sinana. <verse eid="JHN 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>Yohannis makena kaamaason odere barneen ane hame nawoosasin isa Simon Phexirosni ay sina Andriyas feer. <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>Bar zeemme ayba Simooniki hamme: «Mesiisin danniwa» yi. Mesi uus muudto uu. <verse eid="JHN 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>Yesusniki dey ephphe ye. Yesus barin biire: «Ne Yona'ani Simoonwa, ne hawungneen ekalo ‹Keefa› yisteratu teegtotawa» yi. Kotbaas dey «Phexiros wedey Inya shu'a» uwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Girikni kaamak «inya shu'a» uu «Phexiros».</char></note><verse eid="JHN 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Filiphosninnawa Naatinaelninna Teege</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>Wonotirik Yesus Galiila hamanak shole. Filiphosnin dey danne: «Taneen ane hamniwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>Filiphoos dey Andriyasnawa Phexirosna asimato Betesayidaki katamaassitu feesefe. <verse eid="JHN 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>Filiphoos Naatinaelnin danne: «Museni tumaassinawa raajjuni meya basa chowbaason tichisete barin daningwa. Esiis dey Yosefni naa Naaziretki Yesuswa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>Naatinael dey: «Naaziretun ma'a wuza kesak chimniroso?» yi. Filiphoos: «Yaara biwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 1:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>Yesus dey Naatinael hang barki yeefeen biyaat: «Futoni Israelni asu hanifewa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 1:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>Naatinael dey: «Taan ayik arifasso?» yit mamsi. Yesus wolgire: «Filiphoos teegonoyfeen Belesini i'oosi diisi diifen biingwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 1:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Naatinael wolgire: «Assinynyano! Ne Ha'oni naawa. Ne Israelni taatowa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 1:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>Yesus wolgire: « ‹Belesini i'oosi diisi diifen biingwa› yina boor'anoso amanetari? Haniistan denalo wuzanu biyatarwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/>Futok nittok makefawungwa; Samaas gachchefaan Ha'oosi wosiya daa Asuni Naaski kerefeennawa kesfeenna biyatiwa» yi.<verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Qaanaki Sargini Kootaasta Beste</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Keezsinari wono Galiilani awurajjaassi Qaanani katamaassi sargi faar. Yesusni intoos dey estak faar. <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>Yesusnawa nawoni meena es sargiista teegtesere feeseter. <verse eid="JHN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>Waynini ushaas ko'ifana kabaasik Yesusni intoos: «Waynini ushbesiis koi'faantu feesetewa!» yira Yesusnik make. <verse eid="JHN 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>Yesus wolgire: «Intonaase! eekin taan awu zaguwa yifasse? Ta wonaas hashnu aane kar'awe» yi. <verse eid="JHN 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>Yesusni intoos dey wostinynyani meyak: «Bar makena baron zuutira zagutiwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>Ayhudni meya masere kayimefe tumaasimato issun shu'ni waasha esta diisefar. Isa isarbaas hep wedey keez gima akatu ephfa. <verse eid="JHN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>Yesus wostinynyani meyak: «Waashasikitosi aka tuunutiwa» yin noonobaastaneen katisere tuunisete. <verse eid="JHN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>Estan Yesus: «Hash kitta kootaasi gaanynyanik imtiwa» yin imete. <verse eid="JHN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>Gaanynyaas waynini usha sina akaason bechchire biin ayin yaanamato aane aruwe. Sinuntano akaason kita wostinynyani meya arsedifer. Gaanynyaas mariisin teegere <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>«Asu zuuttambaase zeemme ma'a waynini ushaasontu imfe. Estan ushshe zaysetenneen orfo manguuson imfe. Ne ma'a waynini ushaason hashneen duusaan diifar» yi. <verse eid="JHN 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Yesus es biistera artonoy wuzason zeemme Galiilaki fa Qanak zaguk ulfinbaason ammanon besi. Nawoni meya dey barik amanesete. <verse eid="JHN 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>Esseen orfo Yesus intobaasneen, aybaasakitonen, nawoni meyaneen ane Kifirnahom kersete. Estak garo wona diisete.<verse eid="JHN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Betemeqdesiissi Nagadefe Baassotin Kisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>Ayhudni meeni faasikani heeboos tai'sera faar. Yesus Yerusalem kesi. <verse eid="JHN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/>Betemeqdesi yaboosta miyaason, fantuuson, nakalooson waagsefe baassotin dani. Dey oom waaga soolefe baasso diisefa waaga soolesefen bi. <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>Gaaduni alangga ma'ire fantuusonnawa miyaasonna zuutire betemeqdesiisi yabotan kalle kisi. Sooltefa waagbesiison dey sikere tarabbezaason shelgire ha'i. <verse eid="JHN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>Nakalo waagsefe baassotin: «Han baron hantan ephpha kesti! Abataasa keyanon nagadni keya zagutiita!» yi. <verse eid="JHN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/>Nawoni meya dey: «Keeneesik fa ta seektoos taan mawa» yistera tichchenamato gasasisete. <verse eid="JHN 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Ayhudni meya dey: «Han zagifata barik aro biistera artonoy wuza innok besutasso?» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>Yesus wolgire: «Han betemeqdesiis kiddiste kiddusaninon bogaani ta keessinari wono wolgira keer'anawa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>Ayhudni meya: «Han betemeqdesiis kiddiste kiddusani acheechasire issune neya koi'siratu keetera kesi. Eekin ne aakkak keessinari wono keer'a?» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Sinuntano Yesus basa atusontu: «Betemeqdesi kiddiste kiddusani» yire make. <verse eid="JHN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Es bari boor'a Ha'oos Yesusnin kitun kabinanneen orfo nawoni meya es baron makenamato nibesiista keji. Estan tichaasewa Yesus makena kaamaasonna amanesete. <verse eid="JHN 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>Yesus faasikani heeboosi wono Yerusalemuk zagina biistera artonoy wuzason biyete boor'a showo asuni meya barik amanesete. <verse eid="JHN 2:23"/><verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24-25"/>Bar asusa nibsi fa wuzason zuutire arir sinna boor'a oonu asuni chowa barik makonak aane sholsifa. Yesus asuni meyanon zuutire arifena boor'a baassotin aane amanefe.<verse eid="JHN 2:24-25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesusnawa Nikodimosna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Ferisawini keen sina Ayhudni gaannye meyaassin isa Nikodimos yiste asu feer. <verse eid="JHN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>Bar isa wono talmak Yesusniki yeere: «Assinynyano! Ha'o barneen sinna asu sina shakaanane han ne zagifata biistera artonoy wuzasikitonon zaguk chimnir aafewa. Es bari boor'a ne Ha'okin ye assinynya sintamato arifeniwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>Yesus wolgire: «Futo neek makefangwa: Asu hepsa koonto shakaanane Ha'oosi taatonon biyanak aafa chimanawuza» yi. <verse eid="JHN 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>Nikodimos dey: «Asu kur'inanneen orfo aakkak hepsa koontok chimnirinso? Hepsak intobaasi keensi girire koontok chimniroso?» yi. <verse eid="JHN 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>Yesus wolgire: «Futo neek makefangwa: Asu akakinnawa Ha'oni ayyanakinna koonto shakaanane Ha'oosi taatosi giruk aafa chimanawuza. <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/>Asunikin koonte bar asuwa. Sinuntano Ha'oosi Ayyanakin koonte bar Ha'ooskin gaddo kaa daniwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/>‹Hepsi koontotik sholsuwa› yina boor'a diinqotaatawa. <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/>Siru sholena daatu sirifawa. Kaambaasontu odota. Sinuntano ayin yaanamatonawa ay hamdifanamatona aane arifewa. Ha'oosi ayyanakin koonte bar zuuttambaase esiisimatowa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>Nikodimos: «Han bar aakkak sinanak chimnirinso?» yire mamsi. <verse eid="JHN 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>Yesus wolgire: «Ne arto Israelni assinynya sinna faafaat han baron aane arifenoso? <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/>Futo neek makefangwa: Arifeni barontu makefeni, biini bariktu zaala makefeni. Makefeni baronu aane ephpha taafeti. <verse eid="JHN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/>Han daastaki chowanon makena amanonoy nitto den samaki chowaason makefaanane aakkak amanoti? <verse eid="JHN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/>Den saman kere Asuni Naasneen oom den sama kesar oonu aafewa. <verse eid="JHN 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14"/>Muse ichma daassi bittak wosuste zawuni besoson suutnaysimato Asuni Naa suuttonak sholsuwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15"/>Esiis dey Asuni Naanik amanefe bar zuuttambaase koi'ba foonto kaaba foonakwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/>Barik amanefe bar zuuttambaase koi'ba foonto kaa dananaktano tishunoynamato Ha'oos isa nawuba bar barin aatira imma han daason baak keeshtewa. <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/>Ha'o isa naabaasin han daasta wosinaas daasta mangsuni kar'ak sinnoynamato han daason barki kamo fu'okwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>Barik amanefe basaasta mangsu aafa katona wuza. Sinuntano amanonoy bar isa Ha'oosi naa bar barik amano beyna boor'a mangsu basaasta katewa. <verse eid="JHN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/>Chaarefaas han daasta ya. Asuni meya wostobesiis mangu sinna boor'a chaarefaason beyfaat talmaason shunete. Esiistu mangsuni kar'aaswa. <verse eid="JHN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/>Manguuson zagife bar zuuttambaase chaarefaason oomterwa. Wostobaas ammanon kesnoynamato chaarefaaski aane yeefe. <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/>Sinuntano Ha'o sholefana wostooson zagife bar wostobaas Ha'oosik ammanon bestonak chaarefaaski yeefewa» yi.<verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusnawa Haphquni Yohannisna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>Esseen orfo Yesus nawoni meyaneen ane Yuudani daa hamete. Estak baassoneen ane feefaat haphqidifer. <verse eid="JHN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/>Yohannis dey Salemni tai'soosta fa Henonuk showo aka faar sinna boor'a estak haphqit feer. Asuni meya haphuktok yeefaafe haphuktet feeseter. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/>Es bar sinnaas Yohannis taatoni keer girunoy feen. <verse eid="JHN 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>Yohannisni nawoni meenawa isa Ayhudni asuna asi ganeyaassi Ayhudni meeni tumaassi fa kayimni chowaasik kirikkiri kabi. <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>Yohannisnik yeesere: «Assinynyano! Yordanosni akaasi yesalo awa kesnarki neneen ane feena kabaasik ne basa chowaason zaala maketa bar dey haphqidiferwa. Showo asuni meya dey barki hamediferwa» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>Yohannis wolgire: «Den saman imtonoyfeen asu isa wuza ephphetook aafawa chimanawuza. <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/>‹Yoonir yiste muudtos tatewa. Sinuntano basa sinaastatu wostera yaangwa› yira makenamato nittonu zaala makotiwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>Mariyaas mariisarwa, mariisin argasuk ane fe muzgituus mariisa kaamanon odefena kabaasik akamanontu girefewa. Es giraas dey taarwa. Es giraas dey hash siniwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>Bar arkittonak, ta dey hatonak sholsuwa.<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>Denun yooni bar zuuttambaase asi denalowa. Han daastaki bar han daastakirwa. Han daastaki chowatu makefa. Saman yooni bar zuuttambaase asi denalowa. <verse eid="JHN 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>Biina baronnawa odena baronnatu zaala makefe. Sinuntano zaalbaason oonu aane ephpheteefe. <verse eid="JHN 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>Makefena zaalni kaambaason ephphete bar Ha'oos futo sinbaason gasasi. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>Ha'oos Ayyanabaason tuunira imfana boor'a Ha'o wosina bar Ha'oosi kaamanontu makefewa. <verse eid="JHN 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/>Abaas naasin keeshter; zuuttambaase asin kushubaassi imi. <verse eid="JHN 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>Nawubaasik amanefe bar zuuttambaase koi'ba foonto kaaba faarwa. Nawubaasik amanonoy bar Ha'oosi gi'atu basaasta foonirtano kaason aafa danana wuza.<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesusnawa Samariyaki Mashkasuse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1"/>Ferisawini meya Yesus Yohannisniitan arkissire showo asuni nawoba zagire haphqit feenamato odesete. <verse eid="JHN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2"/>Sinuntano haphqiis Yesus sinnoynaron nawobaasakitotu haphqit feer. <verse eid="JHN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3"/>Yesus dey es baron arinaase Yuudani awurajjason beyfaat Galiila hepsa wolle hami. <verse eid="JHN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>Samariyani awurajja kamo aatte hamana sholsira faar. <verse eid="JHN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>Es bari boor'a Yaqob nawuba Yosefnik imna dimaasi teshta fa «Sikar» yistefa Samariyani katama ye. <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>Estak Yaqobni akani doo'a faar. Yesus ugunne kutuk hopina boor'a es doo'aasi tesha di. Es kabaasik wonaasi issun sa'ati sinana. <verse eid="JHN 4:6"/><verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7-8"/>Nawoni meya dey muuni waagosi katama hamete. Es kabaasik Samariyan isa mashkasu akani kitak ya. Yesus barki: «Aka imin ushungwe» yi. <verse eid="JHN 4:7-8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/>Es asus: «Ne Yuudani asu sinfaat ta Samariyani asu sina taakin aakkak aka shiiphotaso?» yi. Ayhudni meya samariyani asuni meyaneen isarbesi aafa sinna boor'atu es baron make. <verse eid="JHN 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>Yesus wolgire: «Ha'oosi imanonnawa ‹Aka taak imin ushungwe› yiis oo sinnamato araatane shiiphoniis newe. Eekan bar dey kaani aka neek imana kabawe» yi. <verse eid="JHN 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Asus dey wolgira ekka yi: «Ne kitata wuzne aafawa. Doo'aas dey yeet wokawa. Eekin kaani aka Ayin dana? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>Ne han akani doo'aason innok ima abani Yaqobniistan arkutaroso? Barneen naanggotbaasneen waagbaasneen han barontu ushetewa.» <verse eid="JHN 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>Yesus wolgire: «Han akaason ushfe baasso zuuttere hepsa wolletu iktosonewe. <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/>Ta imana akaason ushni baasso zuuttere koi'ba foonto neya isanne aafa iktosone wuza. Ta imana akaason ushni barik [Ha'oni Ayyana] basaassi koi'ba foonto kaani kor'atu sinana» yi. <verse eid="JHN 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Asus dey: «Han asuso! Iktonoynamatonawa akani kissi hanta wolla yoonoynamato es akaason taak imma» yi. <verse eid="JHN 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>Yesus dey: «Hamfaat teegoneesin teegera wolla hanta yowe» yi. <verse eid="JHN 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>Asus wolgira: «Teegota aafewa» yi. Yesus: « ‹Teegota aafe› unees ma'aron maketwe. <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/>Ne uuch teegoniki girira kestarwe. Hash neneen ane fe barnu teegonete sinna boor'a maketaas futowe» yi. <verse eid="JHN 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Asus dey: «Han asuso! Ne raajju sintamato aringwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>Inno abani meya han aamaasiktu sagadesetewa. Sinuntano nitto dey ‹Asuni meya sagadosonek sholsifanaas Yerusalemukwa› yisefeti» yi. <verse eid="JHN 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>Yesus dey ekka yi: «Han asuse, han aamaasik wedey Yerusalemuk Abaasik sagadonooyti wona yoonamato amanowe. <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/>Nitto Samirawiis arunoyti Ha'oktu sagadesefeti. Sinuntano faru yoonaas Ayhudnikin sinna boor'a inno arifeni Ha'oosiktu sagadefeni. <verse eid="JHN 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/>Sinuntano futok sagadesefe baasso Abaasik kayma Ayyanaknawa futokna sagadosone wona yoona. Es bar dey hash siniwa. Abaas dey sagadosonek effatenaasontu sholefe. <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/>Ha'oos korto Ayyanawa. Barik sagadesefe baasso dey korto Ayyanaknawa futoosikna sagadosonek sholsuwa.» <verse eid="JHN 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Asus dey: «Kiristoos yistefe Mesiis yoonamato arifawungwa. Bar yeere zuuttambaase asin innok makona» yi. <verse eid="JHN 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>Yesus dey: «Han neneen wolefees ta barwe» yi. <verse eid="JHN 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Es kabaasik nawoni meya hameteessin wolle yeesete. Yesus mashkasusneen wollobaasik diinqesete. Sinuntano: «Awu sholedifa wedey Asusneen Awagan wolledifa?» yire mamsir oonu aafe. <verse eid="JHN 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Estan asus gimaason estak beyfaat katama hamma asuni meyak: <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>«Ta zagina baron zuutire make asusin yaafaat biitiwa. Toogiso bar Kiristoos sina beyungeso?» yi. <verse eid="JHN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>Asuni meya dey katamaassin kesere barki yeesete. <verse eid="JHN 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Es kabaasik nawoni meya: «Assinynyano! Maktetwa muwa» yit shiiphsete. <verse eid="JHN 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Sinuntano bar: «Nitto arunoytir ta muuna muu taak faarwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Es bari boor'a nawoni meya: «Bar muuna muu ephphe ye asu feerteso?» yisesete. <verse eid="JHN 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>Yesus baassok ekka yi: «Ta muu taan wosi basa safaraason zagunewa wostobaason koi'sunakwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/>Nitto ‹Meeni zuutu kar'anak acheech assatu faarwa› yifetitanoso? Ese nittok makefawungwa ‹Kaanna hash meyaas katnamato fosshaason biitiwa› yifawungwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/>Kar'ni bar wostobaasi waaganon ephphetoonirwa. Koi'ba foonto kaak sinni gaana zuutuna. Es bari boor'a bukni barnawa kar'ni barna ane girosone. Ese bukfeesewa kar'feese isaruk girsonekwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/>‹Isaas bukana isa ay kar'ana› yifa kaamaas han baristak futo siniwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/>Ta nitto hopunoytiison kar'atik wosingwa. Oom meyaas hopsesete. Sinuntano nitto baasso hopsesete baron zuutiti.»<verse eid="JHN 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>Mashkasus: «Ta zagina baron zuutire taak makewa» yira makena kaamaasik es katamaassi feese Samariyaki asuni meyaassin showobesiis barik amanesete. <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Samariyaki asuni meya Yesusniki yeesefe kabaasik showo wona baassoneen ane foonak shiiphsete. Bar dey esta hep wona feeshi. <verse eid="JHN 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>Yesus makena kaamaasik oom showo asuni meya amanesete. <verse eid="JHN 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>Mashkasusik dey: «Hanneen ekalo ne maketa boor'a sinnoynamato inno teetniisik odeni boor'a bar futoknu han daason fatunir sinnamato ariniwe» yisete.<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Herashoosa Naanin Fati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Hep wonaneen orfo estan wolle Galiila hami. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/>Yesus zeemme «Raajju basa daasta aane ulfintefe» yire makenar faar. <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/>Sinuntano Galiila kar'fena kabaasik Galiilaki asuni meya faasikani heeboosik Yerusalem hamfena kabaasik Yesus zagina chowaason biyete boor'a barin ma'arik ephpheteesete. <verse eid="JHN 4:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>Esseen orfo Yesus akaason wayinini usha zagire soolena daa Galiilaki Qaana hepsa wolle ye. Es kabaasik Kifirnahomuk naaba mettena isa taatoni herasho feer. <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>Herashoos Yesus Yuudan Galiila yeenamato ode. Naabaas kitunak akamanon mettere feer sinna boor'a Yesusniki yeere: «Kifirnahom kerera naataasin fataywa» yire shiiphphe. <verse eid="JHN 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>Yesus dey: «Nitto biistera artonoy wuznewa diinqi chowne biya shakaatine isanne aane amanefetiwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 4:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>Herashoos dey: «Daamtaaso! Naataas kitunoy feen tai'ni kar'wa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 4:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>Yesus barik: «Hamma! Naanees farunawa» yi. Asus Yesus barik makena kaamaason amanere hami. <verse eid="JHN 4:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>Wolle hamfeen basa wostinynyani meya barin sholok kesere ugunta uphsere: «Naas fariwa» yisere maksete. <verse eid="JHN 4:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>Bar: «Naas apun sa'atikinso farinari?» yire mamsin. Baasso wolugsere: «Hazo naafun sa'atiktu atubaasi gumtana gafkiwa» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 4:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>Naasa aba dey Yesus: «Naanees farunawa» yinaas es sa'atiista sinnamato ari. Barnawa keerki asuni meyaneen ane amanesete. <verse eid="JHN 4:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Esiis dey Yesus Yuudan Galiila yeere zagina hepsa biistera artonoy wuza.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Isa Laafa Asunin Fati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>Esseen orfo Ayhudni meeni heebo faar sinna boor'a Yesus den Yerusalem kesi. <verse eid="JHN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>Yerusalemuk fantuus girifaat kesfana finynyaasi tesha isa kuphira kuni aka faar. Es akaas Ibrawini meeni kaamak «Betezata» yisteratu teegtefa. Bar dey uuch tukbaasta ukbare yere finoba faar. <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3"/>Es finoossi showo mettan aaftishu, laafanawa engitfe meena esta kunsefer. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Girikni tichaassi faadba keeziistan hamma acheech kar'a fa baron aane daysifa.</char></note>[Baasso dey akaasi shorkonon oodet feeseter. <verse eid="JHN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4"/>Aat aatta daamiisa wosiya kuphira kuni akaassi keretaafa akaason shorkit faar. Es akaasi shorkoneen orfo zeemme akaassi giri asu aaffa tesa meroossinnu farit feer.] <verse eid="JHN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Estak keezasire nangne neya laafa sinne fe isa asu feer. <verse eid="JHN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>Yesus es asusin kunfeen biyaat hashneen kar'e showo neya ekkak feenamato araat: «Farutak sholefatoso?» yi. <verse eid="JHN 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>Mettan asus: «Daamtaaso! Akaas shorkefana kabaasik taan akaassi kessuni asuta aafewa; ta giruk hamfana kabaasik oom asu zeemfe» yi. <verse eid="JHN 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>Yesus dey: «Kabira opponeeson wor'a hamma!» yi. <verse eid="JHN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>Mettan asus geregere farire oppobaason wor'e hami. Es bar sinnaas beysani wonakwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/>Ayhudni meya fari asusin: «Hash hawung beysani wona sinna boor'a opponeeson wor'atak aane chimsifawa» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>Sinuntano bar: «Taan fati asus ‹Opponeeson wor'a hamma› yiwa» yire wolgi. <verse eid="JHN 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>Baasso dey: « ‹Opponeeson wor'a hamma› yi asus bar oonso?» yire mamussete. <verse eid="JHN 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Yesus eksere daraasa ganesi giri sinna boor'a fari asus oo fatinamato aane aruwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Esseen orfo Yesus fatina asusin betemeqdesiissi danne: «Ese haye faritwa. Haniistan denalo wuza neyista kar'noynamato hanneen ekalo boor'a wostotaatawa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Asus hamme Ayhudni meyak: «Taan fatiis Yesuswa» yire make. <verse eid="JHN 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Beysani wonaasik es baron zagina boor'a Ayhudni meya Yesus kesse girunoynamato kalak sholset feeseter.<verse eid="JHN 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>Sinuntano Yesus: «Abataas hash hawungneen kar'e wostedife. Ta dey wostenarwa» yire wolgi. <verse eid="JHN 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>Esenu beysani wonaason ooda beybaas bar bar sinnoynamato teetbaason dey Ha'ooseen isar zagire: «Ha'oos taak abatawa» yina boor'a Ayhudni meya akamanon woruk sholset feeseter.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ha'oni Naasa Ha'suni Hugna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>Tusire dey baassok ekka yi: «Futo nittok makefawungwa, Abaas zagifeen biinaysontano naas teetbaasik isa wuzane zagunak aafa chimanawuza. Abaas zagifena barontu zuutire naas dey zagifewa. <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/>Abaas naasin keeshter sinna boor'a bar zaguna baron zuutire besifewa. Nittonu diinqotimato haniistan denalo wostonu besuna. <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/>Abaas kituussinnu kabgire kaa imfenasimato naas dey sholsefe baassok kaa imfewa. <verse eid="JHN 5:21"/><verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22-23"/>Asu zuuttere Abaasin ulfinsifenasimato naasin dey ulfinsunak mangsuni kar'aason zuutire naabaasik aatire imiwa. Es bari boor'a Abaas ooniistanu sinfaanane aafa mangsu kar'anawuza. Naasin ulfinsunoy bar wosi Abaasin aafa ulfinsunawuza.<verse eid="JHN 5:22-23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>«Futo nittok makefawungwa, kaamnaason odefe barnawa taan wosi barik amanefe barna koi'ba foonto kaaba faarwa. Bar kituni keeruntu kaani keer finiteno basaasta aafa mangsu katona wuza. <verse eid="JHN 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/>Futo nittok makefawungwa, kituni meya Ha'oosi naani kaamanon odosone wona yoonawa. Wonaas dey hashwa. Odefe baassonu kaak foosone. <verse eid="JHN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/>Abaas teetbaasik kaaba faanamato naas dey teetbaasik kaaba foonak imiwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/>Asuni Naa sinna boor'a mangsuni kar'ni ha'suni hugna imiwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/>Es barik diinqotiitawa, moogaassi fe baasso zuuttere kaambaason odosone dey moogaassin kesone wona yoona. <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/>Ma'aron zagi baasso kitun kabire kaak foosone. Mangunon zagi baasso kitun kabiseten baassosta mangsu katona.<verse eid="JHN 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusnik Zaala Make Asuni Meya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/>«Ta ta teetaasik isa wuzane zaguk aafa chimanawuza. Mangsu kar'anaas Abaaskin odena baron koi'bawa. Taan wosi basa safaraasontano ta safaraason zaguk aane sholefat sinna boor'a mangsuni kar'naas futowa. <verse eid="JHN 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>Ta ta teetaasiron zaala makefaanane kaamnaason futo zagire ephphetoonir aafewa. <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/>Taak zaala makoniis Abaaswa; Barnu taak makona zaalaas futonir sinnamato arifawungwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/>Nitto Yohanniisiki wosinin wositi. Yohannis dey futok zaala makewa. <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/>Ta asuni zaala aane sholefat; Sinuntano nitto farutiktu Yohannis makena zaalaason makedifawungwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/>Yohannis saamfat chaarsi tonane feerwa. Nitto dey garo wona es chaarefaasik girok sholseti. <verse eid="JHN 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/>Sinfanaknu ta chowaason Yohannisniistan denalo makoni zaala faarwa. Ta koi'sunak Abataas taak imna wosto han zagifana barwa. Abataas taan wosinamato zaala taak makonirwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/>Taan wosi Abaas taak zaala makewa. Nitto kaambaason isanne aane odosoweti. Gitobaasonnu aane biyosoweti. <verse eid="JHN 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/>Bar wosina barin amano beyti boor'a kaambaas nittoossi aafa foona wuza. <verse eid="JHN 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/>Nitto barik koi'ba foonto kaa danatinne faar sinna bestefaan tichaason wee'efetiwa. Es tichaasnu taaktu zaala makefawa. <verse eid="JHN 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/>Sinfanaknu nitto kaanti foonak taaki yoo aane sholofeti.<verse eid="JHN 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>«Ta asunikin ulfina aane sholefat. <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/>Sinuntano Ha'ooson keeshto nibnitiissi aafa sinnamato arifawungwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/>Abataasa sunak ye taan aane ephphatoweti. Oomiis teetbari sunak yeen barin ephpha taasetir. <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/>Nittotna nittotna wal ulfina sholet fe nitto isa Ha'ooskin bestoni ulfinaason aane sholefeti sinna boor'a aakkak amanok chimatirinso? <verse eid="JHN 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/>Ta Abaasa sina nittotin malatonanne faar sinna bestonaatawa. Nittotin malatoniis nitto abdatefeti Musewa. <verse eid="JHN 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/>Museni amaneseti sinfaanane taan dey amanoti kabawa. Bar ta chowaason tichire feer. <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/>Tichaason amano shakfaatine kaamnaason aakkak amanotirinso?»<verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Uuch Kum Arqasunin Muu Maasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>Esseen orfo Yesus Tiberiyados yistefa Galiilani baarisi yesalo hami. <verse eid="JHN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>Mettanni meyanon fatuk zagina biistera artonoy wuza biisete boor'a showo dara barki hamete. <verse eid="JHN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>Yesus nawoni meyaneen ane aamaasta kesse di. <verse eid="JHN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Ayhudni faasikani heeboos tai'sera faar. <verse eid="JHN 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Yesus showo dara barki yeesefeen kaanne biyaat Filiphosnin: «Han baasso muusonek tusha Ayin waagonirinso?» yi. <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>Bar zaguna baron arifet Filiphosnin fattanok es baron mamsi. <verse eid="JHN 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>Filiphoos: «Garo garonon isa isarbesiis muusonek hep tiya wona wosuste wostoni waagni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hep tiya diinari.</char></note> birrik waagte tusha aafawa hoorona wuza» yire wolgi. <verse eid="JHN 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>Nawobaasakitonisin isaas Simon Phexirosni ay sina Andriyas Yesusnik ekka yi: <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>«Uuch muuma tushnewa hep kurxummine epho naa hanta feerwa. Sinuntano effetena daranik Awagira kar'ni?» <verse eid="JHN 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>Yesus: «Asuni meya duusonek zagutiwa» yi. Estak akama kuwa faar. Es diise baassossin arqasus uuch kum sinnir. <verse eid="JHN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>Yesus uuch tushaason ephphe galattefaat diise baassok hooroniison haa'osonek nawoni meyak imi. Kurxummiison dey esiisimato. <verse eid="JHN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>Meesere gawsetenneen orfo Yesus nawoni meyanon: «Isanne zigunoynamato fu'tana battooson zuututiwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>Baasso dey maaste uuch hagewni tushaastan fu'te batto zuutire asire heppe masa tuumi. <verse eid="JHN 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>Estan kabi chowa asuni meya Yesus zagina biistera artonoy wuzason biyeteese: «Han bar futok han daasta yoonak fe raajjuuswa» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>Es bari boor'a Yesus yeesere barin ephere taato zaguk sholsetemato arifaat hepsa wolle bar bar den aamaasta hami.<verse eid="JHN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Akaasta Taarire Kuti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Waalfana kabaasik nawoni meya yeet baariiski kersete. <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>Goonuussi diisere baarisi yesalo Kifirnahom finak kabsete. Es kaba talmera faar. Yesus dey baassoki aane yowe. <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>Akama hugnabare yere siru sirit faar sinna boor'a baariis shorke. <verse eid="JHN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>Uuch wedey issun kilometrine<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:19</char><char style="ft" closed="false">10,000 hamma 12,000 woriya sinana.</char></note> faaron hametenneen orfo Yesus akaasta taarire kutit goonuuski tai'sefena kabaasik baasso biyaat digsete. <verse eid="JHN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>Sinuntano bar: «Tawa! Digotiita!» yi. <verse eid="JHN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Bar goonuussi girire duunak sholsete; geregerenu goonuus hamme kar'one dimaasta kar'i.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Kaani Tusha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>Wonotirik baarisi yesalo yere daraas isa goonu tano estak ooma goonu aafa sinnamatonawa nawoni meya baasso baassotu hamerteno Yesus baassoneen aane giruwe sinbaason arsete. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Sinuntano ooma goonuusikito Tiberiyadosni katamaassin Yesus suusna tushaason meesete dimaasi tesha yeesete. <verse eid="JHN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Asuni meya dey Yesus wedey nawoni meya estak aafsato sinbesiison araat goonuusikitosi diisere Yesusnin sholset Kifirnahom wolsete. <verse eid="JHN 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>Es baarisi teshan danere: «Assinynyano! Hanta aagenso yaatari?» yisete.<verse eid="JHN 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>Yesus wolgire: «Futo nittok makefawungwa, taan sholetiis tusha maara gawseti boor'atano biistera artonoy wuza biiti boor'atawa. <verse eid="JHN 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/>Tishuni tushaasik wostotiitawa. Sinuntano Asuni Naa nittok imana koi'ba foonto kaak sinni tushaasik wostoti. Aba Ha'oos artoni maatama basaasta ichi.»<verse eid="JHN 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>Baasso dey: «Eekin Ha'oosi wostonon wostonik awu zagunik sholsifaso?» yisete.<verse eid="JHN 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>Yesus wolgire: «Es Ha'oosi wostoos bar wosina barik amanotikwa» yi.<verse eid="JHN 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>Es bari boor'a baasso dey ekka yisete: «Ese, inno biira amanonik ne aro biistera artonoy wuza zagutasso? Awunu wostotasso? <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/>‹Muusonek den saman tusha baassok imiwa› yistera tichchenaasimato abaniisakito ichma daassi Manna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Israelni meya ichma daassi Manna saman keren meesete.</char></note> meesetewa.»<verse eid="JHN 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>Yesus ekka yi: «Futo nittok makefawungwa, saman tusha imaas Musetewa. Futoni tusha saman imniis Abataaswa. <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/>Ha'oosi tusha barnu saman kerera han daastaki fe asunik dey kaa imnirwa.» <verse eid="JHN 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>Baasso dey: «Daamniiso! Es tushaason wonna wonnatu imatawa» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>Yesus baassok ekka yi: «Kaa imni tusha tawa. Taaki yooni bar [kaa] isanne aafa maktona wuza. Taak amanefe bar wonna wonna isanne aafa iktona [kaa] wuza. <verse eid="JHN 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/>Sinuntano taan biira amano beynitiisik han baron nittok makengwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/>Abataas imna baasso zuuttere taaki yoosone. Taaki yoosoni baassotin dey isanne gerakalo aafa kisuna wuza. <verse eid="JHN 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/>Ta sholena baron zagunaktawa, taan wosi basa safaranon zagunaktu saman kerengwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/>Taan wosi basa safara taak imna baassotin zuutira isanne tishkunoynamato mangsuni kar'ni wono kitun kabgunakwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/>Abataasa safara Naasin biire barik amanefe baasso zuuttesere koi'ba foonto kaa danonekwa. Es baassotinnu ta mangsuni kar'ni wono kitun kabgunawa.» <verse eid="JHN 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>Ayhudni meya dey: «Saman kere kaani tusha tawa» ubaasik unyisete. <verse eid="JHN 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>Ekka dey yisete: «Haniis ababaasinnawa intobaasona arifeni Yosefni naa Yesustenoso? Eekin aakkak: ‹Samantu kerengwa› yifeso?» <verse eid="JHN 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>Yesus wolgire ekka yi: «Nittotna nittotna unyutiitawa. <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/>Taan wosi abataas zataananetano oonu taaki yook aafawa chimanawuza. Ta mangsuni kar'ni wono barin kitun kabgunawa. <verse eid="JHN 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/>Raajjuni tichaassi: ‹Zuuttambesiise Ha'okin arir sinonewa› yistera tichche. Esenu Abaaskin odere ari bar zuuttere taaki yoona. <verse eid="JHN 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/>Ha'ooskin sina shakaanane Abaasinnu biyar oonu aafewa. Abataaskin sina bar bartu biyarwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/>Futo nittok makefawungwa; Taak amanefe bar koi'ba foonto kaaba faarwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/>Kaani tusha tawa. <verse eid="JHN 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/>Abantiisakito ichma daassi Manna meesete. Sinuntano kitisete. <verse eid="JHN 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/>Saman kere tushaas haniiswa, Es tushaason muuni bar aafa kituna wuza. <verse eid="JHN 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/>Saman kere kaa imni tusha tawa. Asu han tushaason meefaanane koi'ba foonto kaaktu foona. Han daasi asunik kaa sinanak ta imana tushaas ashnaaswa.» <verse eid="JHN 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Ayhudni meya dey: «Han asus ashbaason innok aakkak imak chimnirinso?» yit baassotna baassotna mai'sire karakkarsete. <verse eid="JHN 6:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>Yesus baassok ekka yi: «Futo nittok makefawungwa; Asusa Naani ashaason muu shakaatine harinbaason dey usha shakaatine [Es maa'a sina ashnaason] nitto kaanti aafawa. <verse eid="JHN 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/>Ashnaason meefe barnawa harinnaason ushfe barna koi'ba foonto kaaba faarwa. Ta koi'baasi wono barin kitun kabgunawa. <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/>Ashnaas futoni muu, harinnaas dey futoni ushawa. <verse eid="JHN 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/>Ashnaason meefe barnawa harinnaason dey ushfe barna taneentu foona. Ta dey barneentu foona. <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/>Hayew abataas taan wosinamato ta dey barkin kabi chowa hayew sinnamato ta ashaason meefe bar dey taakin kabi chowa hayew sinana. <verse eid="JHN 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/>Saman kere tushaas haniiswa. Abantiisakito saman kere tushaason meesere kitiseteysimatotawa. Han tushaason meefe bar koi'ba foonto kaaktu foona.» <verse eid="JHN 6:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>Yesus Kifirnahomuk assifena kabaasik han baron Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassik make.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Koi'ba Foonto Kaani Kaama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>Nawoni meyaassin showobesiis odesefaat: «Han bar chima wollawa. Oonso ephphetook chimniri?» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 6:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>Sinuntano Yesus nawoni meya es kaamaasik unyisetemato nibbaassi arifaat ekka yi: «Han bar tuusa'suniroso? <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/>Eeka Asuni Naa zeemme den feenaasta hamfeen biifeti kabaasik awu utisso? <verse eid="JHN 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/>Kaa imfaas Ha'oosi Ayyanawa; asuni hugnaas isanne aane ke'fawa. Ta makena kaamaas kaa imfa Ayyananewa kaanewa. <verse eid="JHN 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/>Sinuntano nittoossin amanonor isa isar feeseter» Yesus baassossin amanonor oo sinnamatonawa barin aatire imniis oo sinnamatona zeemmenu arire feer sinna boor'a es baron make. <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>Tusire dey: «Abaaskin imtonoynaron oonu taaki yook chimnir aafe sinna boor'atu es baron makengwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 6:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>Esseen orfo nawoni meyaassin showobesiis orfo wolsere barneen ane aane hamoto. <verse eid="JHN 6:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Yesus asire heppe nawobaasakitonin: «Nitto dey wolla hamatik sholefetiyoso?» yi. <verse eid="JHN 6:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>Simon Phexiros: «Daamtaaso, ooki wolla hamanirinso? Neeki koi'ba foonto kaa imfa kaama faar. <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/>Ne Korto Ha'oosi Naa sintamato amaneni dey ariniwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 6:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>Yesus wolgire: «Nitto asire heppeesin koriis tatenoso? Nittoossin isaas Dabuloswa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>Es yina bar dey Simonni naa sina Asqorotki Yuudaningwa. Asire heppe nawoosasin isaas sinfenaknu aatire imniis bar sinna boor'atu make.<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesusnawa Aybaasakitona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>Esseen orfo Ayhudni meeni ha'sinynyani meya Yesusnin woruk sholset feeseter sinna boor'a Yuudani daasta wolle hamaason beyfaat Galiilani daasta kutit feer. <verse eid="JHN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/>Ayhudni meeni hafoni heeboos tai'sera faar. <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/>Estan basa ayni meya: «Ne nawoosakito zagifata wostooson biyosonek hantan kabira Yuudaki daasta hamma! <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>Ammanon artok sholefe asu wostobaason aachok wostefer aafewa. Ne dey han wuzasikitonon zagifaatane teetneeson han daasi asunik ammanon besutawa» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>Es baron yisetees aybaasakitonu barik amano beyete boor'a.<verse eid="JHN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Yesus baassok ekka yi: «Ta wonaas hashnu aane kar'awa. Sinuntano nitto wonaas wonna wonna ma'a faarwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/>Han daas nittotin oomtona ugna aafa. Sinuntano ta wostobesiis mangu sinbaason maket faanar sinna boor'a taan oomtesefe. <verse eid="JHN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/>Nitto den heebooski hamti; ta wonaas hashne aane kar'a sinna boor'a den heebooski aafa hamana wuza» <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>Es baron makefaat Galiilak fu'te.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Hafoni Heeboostak Beste</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>Sinuntano aybaasakito heeboni dimaasta hametenneen orfo Yesus dey ammanon sinnoynamato aachere hami. <verse eid="JHN 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Ayhudni meya: «Barki ayinso?» yiset heeboosik ye asusa ganesi sholsete feeseter. <verse eid="JHN 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Daraasa ganesinu basa chowaas akamanon unychedifar. Isa isaas: «Bar ma'a asuwa» yi. Oomiis: «Aanewa! Daraasin esharwa» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Sinuntano Ayhudni meeni gaannye meyanon digsete boor'a oonu basa chowaason ammanon aane wollowe. <verse eid="JHN 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Yesus heeboosi ganetak den betemeqdesiissi hamme assu ephi. <verse eid="JHN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>Ayhudni meya: «Han asus assinynyani meyakin arunoynaron tichaason aakkak aruk chimiso?» yit diinqesete. <verse eid="JHN 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>Yesus wolgire ekka yi: «Ta assifana barnu taakintawa; taan wosi Ha'ooskingwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/>Basa fiqadiison zaguk sholefer feefaanane han assus Ha'okin wedey ta teetakin sinbaason aruk chimana. <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/>Basa teetaassin makefe bar teetbari ulfintotu sholefewa. Sinuntano wosi barin ulfinaason sholefe bar futonirwa. Basaassi esha wuza aafa. <verse eid="JHN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/>Muse tumaason nittok aane imenoso? Sinuntano nittoossin tumaason zagifer isanne aafewa. Taan woruk awuniron sholedifetirinso?» <verse eid="JHN 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Daraas wolugsere: «Kiina ayyana neyissi faarwa! Dey neen oonso woruk sholediferi?» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>Yesus baassok wolgire ekka yi: «Isa biistera artonoy wuza zagina nitto zuuttera diinqeseti. <verse eid="JHN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/>Muse haarkoni kunuusi tumanon nittok imiwa. Es tumaas dey yaanaas abani meyakintano Musenikintawa. Nittonu dey beysani wonak naanggota haarko kunsifete. <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/>Ese Museni tumaas shaartonoynamato beysani wonak naanggota haarko kunir sinnanneen ta asunin beysani wonak fatina boor'a tayista awagan gi'ifetiso? <verse eid="JHN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/>Futoni mangsuni kar'a kar'titano asuni sina biyak mangsu kar'atiitawa.»<verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Haniis Muudto Kiristoosno?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Es kaba Yerusalemuk feese isa isa asuni meya ekka yisete: «Woruk sholsefees han bartenoso? <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>Esenu bar han ammanon makedifewa, isa wuzane aane maksotowa. Gaannye meyanu han asus Kiristoos sinnamato futok arsetetaaso? <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>Sinuntano han bar koontena daas ay sinnamato arinirwa. Kiristoos yeefena kabaasik ayin sinnamato oonu aafa aruna wuza.»<verse eid="JHN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Yesus betemeqdesiissi assifena kabaasik kaambaason teggire ekka yi: «Taan futok arsetirwa; ayin yaanamato dey arsetirwa; ta teetnak aane yootwa. Sinuntano taan wosi bar nitto arunoyti futonirwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/>Barkin yaana boor'anawa bar taan wosina boor'ana ta barin arifawungwa» <verse eid="JHN 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>Es bari boor'a ephonek sholset feeseter. Sinuntano bar oottona wonaas aane kar'a sinna boor'a oonu ephak aane kushubaason aane shongowe. <verse eid="JHN 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>Sinuntano daraasasin showobesiis barik amanesete. Dey: «eekin Kiristoos yeefena kabaasik han bar zagina biistera artonoy wuzaasi denalo zagungeso?» yisete.<verse eid="JHN 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Ephonek Betemeqdesini Tasoni Meyanon Wossete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>Ferisawini meya basa chowaason daraas unyisefen odesete. Maagni gaanynye meenawa Ferisawini meena Yesusnin ephphe yoosonek betemeqdesi tasoni meyanon wossete. <verse eid="JHN 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>Yesus dey ekka yi: «Nittoneen ane foonaas garo wonnirongwa; estan taan wosi barki hamanar. <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/>Nitto taan sholoti; aafa danati wuza; ta faanaasta yook aafa chimati wuza.» <verse eid="JHN 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Ayhudni meya: «Inno barin dannoyni dima ay hamnirinso? Awuzakne Girikni meeni ganeyaassi siktere fe Ayhudni meyaki hamme Aazabni meyanon assunittongwa? <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/>‹Nitto taan sholoti; aafa danati wuza. Ta faanaasta yook aafa chimati wuza› yina kaamaas aambanso?» yit baassotna baassotna wolumsete.<verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaa Imfa Akani Kor'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>Heeboosi koi'ni wonoti arki wonaasta Yesus yerefaat kaambaason: «Oonu ikter feefaanane taaki yeefaat usho. <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/>Taan amanefe bar tichaas makenaasimato kaani akani kor'a basa nibaassin kesanawa» yit make. <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>Yesus es baron makenaas barik amanefe baasso ephphetoosonek fa Ha'oni Ayyanani chowaasikwa. Yesus aane ulfintowe sinna boor'a Korto Ayyanaas aane kerowa.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daraasa Ganesi Oor Oor Kesa Kabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>Daraasasin isa isa meya es kaamaason odeseteyse: «Han bar futok raajjusoso!» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>Oomiis dey: «Han bar muudtowa» yisete. Sinuntano oomiis: «Kiristoos Galiilan aafawa yoonawuza. <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/>Muudtos Dawitni zalaassin koontonamatonawa Dawit feefena katama Betelemun yoonamatona tichaassi aane tichchowanoso?» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Es bari boor'a basa chowaasik daraasa ganesi oor oor kesa sini. <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/>Isa isaas barin ephak sholsete. Sinuntano ephak kushubaason basaasta shonger oonu aafe.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayhudni Ha'sife Baasso Yesusnik Amano Beyete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Estan betemeqdesiisi tasoni meya maagni gaanynye meyakinawa Ferisawini meyakina wolle hameten ekka yire mamussete: «Awuni boor'a Yesusnin ephpha yoo beyetiso?» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>Betemeqdesiisi tasoni meya: «Es asus wollefenaasimato woller oonu aafewa» yire wolugsete.<verse eid="JHN 7:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/>Ferisawini meya dey: «Nitto dey eshtetiyoso? <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>Ha'sife baassossinawa Ferisawini meyaassinna barik amaner feesetertaaso? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>Han Museni tumaason arunoy daraas erwuttowa» <verse eid="JHN 7:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>Ferisawini meyaassin zeemo sinak Yesusniki hama Nikodimos yistefe isaas: <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/>«Inno tumaasimato zeemme isa asu malattena malataas odtonoyfeennawa awu zaginamato artonoyfeenna mangsu aane katefawa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>Baasso dey wolugsere: «Ne dey Galiilakinnoso? Raajju Galiilan aafa kabuna wuza sinnamato tichaason tu'nira aruwa» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53"/>Estan isa isarbesiis keebesi keebesi hamete.<verse eid="JHN 7:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Gerkesfeen Ootte Mashkasu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>Estan Yesus Dabrazayitini kumaasta hami. <verse eid="JHN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Wonotiri wono e'so betemeqdesiissi wolle ye. Daraas zuuttere barki yeesete. Bar dey diifaat baassotin assit feer. <verse eid="JHN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Museni tumaasi assinynyanawa Ferisawini meena gerkesfeen ootte mashkasu teshshesete dara zuuttambaase asi sina yeetisete. <verse eid="JHN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>Yesunik dey ekka yisete: «Assinynyano! Han asus gerkesfeen oottewa. <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/>Innok imte tumaassi es ekka zagifa asus shu'ak ichchera kitunak Muse ajajewa. Ne han bari chowaason awu utasso?» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>Es baron ekka yisetees barkin malatoni chowa danne fattansonek sholsefaatwa. Sinuntano Yesus mugire kushubaasi waay'ak daasta tichu ephi. <verse eid="JHN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>Heppa heppa wolgire mamussobesiise kaanne: «Nittoossin boor'ba foontoos tesuni shu'aason barista ha'ire ichowa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>Hepsa dey mugire daasta tichi. <verse eid="JHN 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>Baasso dey es baron odeseteyse kur'usatan kabire na'oosata kar'e isa isarbesiis estan hamete. Yesus dey dara zuuttambaase asi sina yere Mashkasusneen Yesusneen esta fu'te. <verse eid="JHN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>Yesus kaanne: «Han asuse, neen malate baasso ay feesetese? Neyista mangsu kar'ar isanne aafenose?» yi. <verse eid="JHN 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>Asus dey: «Daamtaaso! Isanne aafewa» yi. Yesus dey: «Ta dey neyista aafawe mangsu kar'anawuza; hamme; hawungneen ekalo gerkesataatawe» yi.<verse eid="JHN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Han Daasi Chaarefa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/>Hepsa dey Yesus baassok: «Ta han daasta fe asusik chaarefawa. Taaki yeefe bar zuuttambaase kaa imfa chaarefaasontu dananatano talmaassi aafa foona wuza» yire make. <verse eid="JHN 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>Ferisawini meya dey: «Ne ne teetaasiktu zaala makefatwa; es maketa zaalaas futotawa» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>Yesus wolgire baassok ekka yi: «Ta ta teetaasi chowanon zaala makefaanane ayin yaanamatonawa ay hamanamatona arifan sinna boor'a zaalnaas futowa. Sinuntano nitto ayin yaanamatonawa ay hamanamatona aane arifetiwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/>Nitto asunimatotu mangsu kar'feti. Ta isa asunita mangsu aafa kar'anawuza. <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/>Mangsu kar'fanaknu taan wosi Abaas taneen anetu fe sinna boor'anawa mangsu kar'fana kabaasik dey ta ta sina beyna boor'ana es mangsuni kar'naas futowa. <verse eid="JHN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/>Hep asu makena zaala futo sinnamato nitto tumaassi tichchera faar. <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/>Es bari boor'a ta teetaasiron tatu zaala makonirwa. Taan wosi abataas dey ta chowaasik zaala makona.» <verse eid="JHN 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>Baasso dey: «Eekin abaneeski ayinso?» yisete. Yesus wolgire: «Taan wedey abataasin futok aane arsefetiwa. Taan arseti sinfaanane abataasin dey aruti kabawa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>Yesus han kaamaason makena betemeqdesiisi waaga zuuttefana saaxiniisi tesha diifaat assifetwa. Sinuntano bar oottona wonaas aane kar'a sinna boor'a oonu barin aane ephe.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Amano Beyni Chowaason Make</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>Yesus dey hepsa: «Ta hamanarwa; nitto dey taan sholsoti. Sinuntano boor'nitiisik kitutir; ta hamana dimaassi nitto yootik aafa chimati wuza» yi. <verse eid="JHN 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Ayhudni meya: « ‹Ta hamana dimaasta nitto yoosotik aafa chimati wuza› ubaas bar barin woruniroso?» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>Bar dey ekka yi: «Nitto han daastakir; ta den samakirwa. Nitto han daastakir; ta han daastakirtewa. <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/>Es bari boor'atu: ‹Nitto boor'nitiisik kitutirwa› yira makengwa. Ta oo sinnamato arira amano beyfaatine boor'nitiisik kitutirwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>Baasso dey: «Eekin ne oonso?» yisete. Yesus wolgire: «Zeemmeneen maket feyiis ta barwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/>Nittoosta showo makona wuznewa showo mangsu kar'ana wuzne faarwa. Sinuntano taan wosi bar futonirwa. Ta dey barkin odena baron han daastaki asunik makefawungwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>Abaasa chowanon makenamato baasso aane arsoto. <verse eid="JHN 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Es bari boor'a Yesus ekka yi: «Nitto Asuni Naanin den teggifeti kabaasik ta bar sinnamato arutiwa. Esiisimato dey abataas taak assina barontu makentano ta taakin isa wuzane aane zagifat sinbaason yaadatotiwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/>Taan wosi bar taneen anewa. Ta wonna wonna zagifanaas barin girsuk sinna boor'a ta taan aane beye» yi. <verse eid="JHN 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>Yesus es wuzasikitonon makobaase showobesiis barik amanesete.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Boor'ni Bozoossin Kesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Yesus barik amanese Ayhudni meyak: «Ta kaamaasik fafaatine futok nitto ta nawowa. <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/>Futooson dey arutiwa; futoos dey birmadumma nittotin kisuna» yi. <verse eid="JHN 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/>Baasso wolugsere: «Inno Abrahamni zalawa; isa asuniknu isanne boz aane sineniwa; aakkak ne innotin ‹Bozoossin kesatirwa› yifasso?» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>Yesus wolgire ekka yi: «Futo nittok makefawungwa; boor'aason wostefe bar zuuttere boor'ni bozwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/>Boz wonna wonna keer aane feefe. Naastu wonna wonna keer feeferwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/>Ese Naas birmadumma kisaanane futok birmadumma kesati. <verse eid="JHN 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/>Abrahamni zala sinnitiison arifawungwa; sinuntano kaamnaason ephpha too beyeti boor'a taan worutik sholefeti. <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/>Ta Abataaskin biina barontu makefan; nitto dey abantiiskin odeti barontu zagsefeti.»<verse eid="JHN 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusnawa Abrahamna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>Ayhudni meya dey barik: «Inno aba Abrahamwa» yisete. Yesus wolgire baassok: «Abrahamni naanggota sineti sinfaanane Abraham zagifenaasimato zaguti kabawa. <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/>Ta Ha'ooskin odena futooson nittok maken. Sinuntano nitto taan woruk sholefeti. Abraham dey ekka aane zaguwe. <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/>Nitto abantiisa wostonontu wostefetiwa» yi. Baasso dey: «Inno gerkesak aane koontoweniwa. Isa abani feer; es bar dey Ha'ooswa» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>Yesus dey ekka yi: «Ha'oos abanti sini sinfaanane taan shunati kabawa. Ta Ha'ooskin yaana boor'a Ha'oostu taan wosirtano ta teetnak aane yootwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/>Awuni boor'anso ta wollaason gasasu beyfetiisi? Kaamnaason odok aane sholefetiwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/>Nitto abanti sina Dabulosni naanggotwa. Abanti sholefena barontu zaguk sholefeti. Bar zeemmeneen kaa worir. Futo barki aafa sinna boor'a futok aane yerefe. Bar eshinynya, eshni aba sinna boor'a esha wollefena kabaasik teetbaassintu wollefe. <verse eid="JHN 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/>Sinuntano ta futo wollefana boor'a nitto aane amanefetiwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/>Nittoossin: ‹Boor'a wostetwa› yire taan wee'ok chimnir oonso? Ta futo wollenar sinfaanane awuniron amano beyfetiso? <verse eid="JHN 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/>Ha'ooskin sina bar Ha'oosi kaamanon oder. Nitto Ha'ooskin sina beyti boor'a aane odefeti» <verse eid="JHN 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>Ayhudni meya wolgire: « ‹Ne Samirawiwa, kiina ayyana dey neyissi faarwa› uniis futotanoso makeniri?» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 8:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>Yesus wolgire ekka yi: «Tayissi kiina ayyana aafawa. Ta abataasin ulfinsinar; sinuntano nitto taan kashshitir. <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/>Sinfanaknu ta teetnaasi ulfinanon aane sholefat. Ta ulfinaason sholefernawa mangsu kar'nirna oom feer. <verse eid="JHN 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/>Futo nittok makefawungwa, kaamnaason oodfe bar isanne aafa kituna wuza.» <verse eid="JHN 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Ayhudni meya: «Neyissi kiina ayyana faanamato haye ariniwa. Abrahamnu kitiwa; raajjuni meya dey kitisetewa. Sinuntano ne: ‹Kaamnaason oodfe bar isanne aafa kituna wuza› yifat. <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>Ne kiti abani Abrahamniistan arkutaroso? Raajjuni meya kitisete. Eekin ne teetneeson oo uu?» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>Yesus wolgire: «Ta teetnaason ulfinsifaanane shimatu sinana. Taan ulfinsuniis nitto: ‹Ha'oni› yisefeti abataaswa. <verse eid="JHN 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/>Nitto barin aane arsefeti; sinuntano ta barin mai'sira arinar. Aane arifat yifaanane nittoosimato eshinynyatu sinana. Sinuntano ta barin mai'sira arinar; kaambaason dey oodnar. <verse eid="JHN 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/>Nitto abanti sina Abraham ta wonaason biyanak akamanon gire; dey biire gire» <verse eid="JHN 8:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>Ayhudni meya dey: «Ne uuchasir woggane kar'noyfeen Abrahamnin biitoso?» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 8:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>Yesus dey: «Futo nittok makefawungwa; Abraham koontonoy feen ta fawungwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 8:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Estan barin ichak shu'a kabugsete; sinuntano Yesus aachere betemeqdesiissin kesse hami.<verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Aaftishu Sinne Koonte Asusin Fati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>Yesus ugunne hamfet aaftishu sinne koonte asunin bi. <verse eid="JHN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>Nawoni meya: «Assinynyano! Han asus aaftishu sinne koontenaas oo wostena boor'aasikinso? Bar wostena boor'asikingwa wedey barin kooni aba intoos wostesete boor'aasikinso?» yire mamussete.<verse eid="JHN 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>Yesus ekka yire wolgi: «Han asus aaftishu sinne koontenaas bar wedey barin kooni aba intoos wostesete boor'aasiktawa. Ha'oosi wosto barki kamo ammanon bestonakwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/>Wonaas chaarefbaase feen taan wosi basa wostonon wostonik sholsifawa. Oonu wostok chimnoyna talma yoonirwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/>Han daasta faana kabaasik ta han daasi chaarefawa.»<verse eid="JHN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>Es baron makefaat daasta tujere ho'a tushire haar'aasik aaftishuusa aafanon woshshaat: <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>«Ek hamfaat Silom yistefa kuphira kuni akaassi masowa» yi. Silom uusi kota: «Wostere hamar» uu. Es bari boor'a hamme dey masere biyet wolle ye.<verse eid="JHN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>Sinati kabaasik shiiphefeen biye asuni meenawa wolkobaasakitona: «Han asus zeemo sinak diifaat shiiphefeen biini bartenoso?» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>Isa isaas: «Barwa» yisete. Oomiis dey: «Indaanewa; gitobaastu barne feerwa» yisete. Asus: «Es aaftishuus tawa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>Asuni meya dey: «Eekin aafnees aakkak biyak chimiso?» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>Bar wolgire: «Yesus yistefe asus ho'a tushire haar'aasik aafnaason woshshaat: ‹Silom yistefa kuphira kuni akaassi hamma masowa› yin; hamma masera biingwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>«Es asus ayinso feenari?» yisete. Bar dey: «Ay feenamato aane arutwa» yi.<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ferisawini Meya Asus Aakkak Farinamato Aruk Sholsete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>Estan asuni meya sinak aaftishu sinne fe asusin ephere Ferisawini meyaki taamete. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/>Yesus es asusa aafanon ho'a tushire haar'aasik woshshire fatinaas beysani wona. <verse eid="JHN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/>Ferisawini meya: «Aakkak biyak chimisso?» yire hepsa asusin mamussete. Bar dey: «Aafnaason ho'a tushire haar'aasik woshshintu masera biyak chimingwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Ferisawini meyaassin isa isaas: «Han asus beysani wonaason aane oodfe sinna boor'a Ha'ooskin yeertewa» yisete. Oomiis dey: «Boor'ba feena asu effatena biistera artonoy wuza aakkak zaguk chimnirinso?» yisete. Baasso ganeyaassi dey oor oor kesa sini. <verse eid="JHN 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Es bari boor'a Ferisawini meya sinak aaftishu sinne fe asusin: «Aafnees biyanak zagi asusa chowanon ne awu yifasso?» yit dey mamussete. Bar wolgire: «Raajjuwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>Ayhudni ha'sinynyani meya es asus aaftishu sinnamatonawa orfo dey biinamatona basa abaasnawa intoose asin teegsere mamussonenneen aane amanosoto. <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>Abaasnawa intoose: «Aaftishu sinnetu koonte yisefeti nitto naas haniiso? Eekin hash aakkak biyak chimi?» yisere mamussete.<verse eid="JHN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>Abaasnawa intoose wolugsere: «Haniis inno naa; aaftishu sinne koontobaason arifeniwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>Sinuntano hash aakkak biinamatonawa aaffaason oo fatinamatona aane arifeni. Bar teetba chim asuwa; barin mamsuti. Basa chowaason bar makona» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>«Kiristooswa» yire make asu feefaanane Ayhudni ha'sinynyani meya Ayhudni zuuttoni keyaassin kalle kissonek zeemme merkesere feeseter sinna boor'a baassotin digsefaattu ekka maksete. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Es bari boor'a abaasnawa intoose: «Bar teetba chim asuwa; barin mamsuti» yisete.<verse eid="JHN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>Estan sinak aaftishu sinne fe asusin hepsak teegesere: «Ne futooson makera Ha'ooson ulfinsuwa. Han asus boor' sinbaason inno arifeniwa» yisete.<verse eid="JHN 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>Sinak aaftishu sinne fe asus wolgire: «Boor'ba faarto aafato aane arifatwa. Ta arifanaas sinak aaftishu sinnaasewa hash dey biyak chimnaase koi'bawa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>Baasso dey: «Aambanso neek zaginari? Aakkakinso aafneeson fatinari?» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>Bar wolgire: «Zeemma nittok makengwa; odok aane sholoweti. Hepsa awuniron odotik sholetiso? Nitto dey basa nawo sinatik sholsedifetiroso?» yi. <verse eid="JHN 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>Barin me'et: «Netu basa nawoteno inno Museni nawowa. <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>Ha'oos Museneen wollenamato inno arifeniwa. Sinuntano han asus ayin sinnamato aane arifeni» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>Asus wolgire ekka yi: «Han asus ayin sinnamato aru shakuntiis diinqi chowawa; sinuntano aafnaason fatiwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>Ha'ooson digefe barinnawa safarabaason dey zagife barinna Ha'oos oderwa. Sinuntano boor'ba faana barin aane odefa sinnamato artowa. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>Aaftishu sinne koonte asuni aafa oonu fatidifen daa testenaneen kabira aane odtowa. <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/>Han asus Ha'ooskin sina shaki sinfaanane isa wuzane zagunak aafa chimanawuza.»<verse eid="JHN 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>Baasso dey: «Boor'ak koonte ne innotin assutaroso?» yisefaat Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassin gerakalo kalle kissesete.<verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayyanak Aaftishu Sina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>Yesus fari asusin Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassin gerakalo kalle kissesetemato ode. Dey danne: «Asuni Naanik amanefatoso?» yi. <verse eid="JHN 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Bar wolgire: «Daamtaaso! Barik amanonak bar oonso?» yi. <verse eid="JHN 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>Yesus dey: «Sina zeemma biitwa; hash dey neneen ane wollefees ta barwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Asus dey: «Daamtaaso! Amanonawa» yit barik sagade. <verse eid="JHN 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>Yesus dey: «Ta han daasta yaanaas mangsuni kar'akwa. Aaftishu sina baasso biyonek; biidifeni yisefe baasso dey aaftishu sinobesiison besukwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Es kabaasik teshba yerse isa isa Ferisawini meya es baron odesere: «Eekan inno dey aaftishunoso?» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>Yesus dey wolgire: «Aaftishu sinefaatine nittok boor'a sinana kabatawa; sinuntano ‹Biidifenir› yisefeti boor'a boor'nitiisneentu fui'totiwa» yi.<verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Ma'a Keemer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>Dey Yesus: «Ta futo nittok makefawungwa; fantuusi olani finynyisi kamo girunoy ooma ugnak girife bar wiiswa; dey bo'inynyawa. <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/>Sinuntano finynyibaasik girife bar fantuusi keemerwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/>Barik finynyaason oodfe bar gachana. Fantuusikito dey kaambaason odona. Basa fantuusikitonon sunba sunbaasik teegere kisuna. <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/>Basa teetni fantuusikitonon zuutire kisinanneen orfo barikitoni sinaasta zeemana. Fantuusikito dey kaambaason arser sinna boor'a orfobaase hamona. <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/>Sinuntano oomiisa kaamanon aane arsefa sinna boor'a basaastan eelatu eelanatano isanne orfobaase aafa hamana wuza» <verse eid="JHN 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>Yesus es besoson baassok make. Sinuntano baasso makena wuzaas awu sinnamato aane arsoto. <verse eid="JHN 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>Hepsa dey Yesus ekka yi: «Futo nittok makefawungwa; fantuusi finynya tawa. <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/>Tayistan zeemme yeese baasso zuuttere wiis; dey bo'inynyawa. Fantuusikito dey baasso kaamaason aane odosowa. <figure style="fig" alt="Sheep in sheepfold with shepherd" file="LB00014B.tif" size="span" ref="10:7">Kezzobaasneen ane balloossi yere fantu </figure><verse eid="JHN 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/>«Finynyaas tawa; taaki kamo girife bar faruna; giruna, kesana, feeshni dima dey danana. <verse eid="JHN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/>Wiisiis wiisere shukke tishkunaktano baak aane yeefe. Sinuntano ta baassok kaa sinanaknawa foobesiisik tuumma fu'te kaa danonektu yaangwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>Ta ma'a keemerwa; ma'a keemeriis kaabaason fantuusikwa iyaat aatire imar. <verse eid="JHN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/>Waagak keemfe bar fantuusikito basar sina beyna boor'a iririka yaafana kabaasik fantuuson ha'aat eelfe. Iririkaas dey fantuuson ephin oomaas siktefa. <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/>Es keemeriis waagaktu keemfe sinna boor'a fantuusik aane safarefe; dey teetbaasiktu eelfe. <verse eid="JHN 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14"/>Ta ma'a keemerwa; ta fantunaason arinarwa. Fantunaasikito dey taan arserwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15"/>Ta barikitonon arifanaas Abaas taan arifenasimatonawa ta dey abataasin arifanasimatowa. Kaanaason dey fantunaasikwa iyaat aatira imanar. <verse eid="JHN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/>Han olaassi foonto gerok ooma fantuna faaser. Barikitonon dey ephpha yoonak sholsuwa. Barikito kaamnaason odosona. Isa wodo sinana; keemeriis dey isar sinana. <verse eid="JHN 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/>Hepsa wolla ephanak kaanaason dey aatira imanar sinna boor'a abataas taan keeshter. <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/>Kaanaason ta shunaasik aatira imana; taakin dey oonu ephanak aafa chimanawuza. Kaanaason aatira imaknawa wolgira dey ephanakna ha'suni hugnana faarwa. Es ajajiison dey dannaas abataaskingwa» <verse eid="JHN 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>Es makena barik hepsa Ayhudni meeni ganeyaassi oor oor kesa sini. <verse eid="JHN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>Baassossin showobesiis: «kiina ayyana basaassi faarwa. Nifasewa; awuniron barin odedifetirinso?» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>Oomiis dey: «Han basa wollaas kiina ayyana basaassi faana asuni wollatawa; kiina ayyana basaassi faana asu aaftishuni aafaason fatunak chimniroso?» yisete.<verse eid="JHN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayhudni Meya Barik Amano Beyete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>Yerusalemuk betemeqdesiison kayimsuni heeboos ulfintona wonaas kar'i; Es assaas dey yeesho. <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>Yesus betemeqdesiissi Solomonni kesfa giruni dagafiyo yistefa dimaasta kutit feer. <verse eid="JHN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>Es kabaasik Ayhudni meya Yesusnin ganeya gedere ekka yisete: «Aageneenninso neen laphphebatet fooniri? Ne Ha'oosi muudto sina Kiristoos sinneeson amma zagira innok makowa.» <verse eid="JHN 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>Yesus baassok wolgire ekka yi: «Nittok makena baron aane amanesefeti; ta abataasa sunak wostefana wostoos ta oo sinnamato taak zaalawa. <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/>Sinuntano nitto ta fantu sina beyeti boor'a aane amanefeti. <verse eid="JHN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/>Ta fantuusikito ta kaamaason odeser; ta dey barikitonon arinar. Taak dey zoonusteser. <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/>Ta koi'ba foonto kaa barikitok imana; isanne aafa tishusonawuza. Ta kushuussin oonu aafa bo'ona wuza. <verse eid="JHN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/>Barikitonon taak ima Abataas zuuttambaase asi denalo. Abataasa kushusinnu barikitonon bo'onir oonu aafe. <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/>Taanawa Abataasna inno isarwa.»<verse eid="JHN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Hepsa dey Ayhudni meya barin ichche woruk shu'a ephete. <verse eid="JHN 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>Yesus dey: «Abataaskin showo ma'a wosto nittok besin; eekin taan ichcha worutiis aaffa wostonasikinso?» yi. <verse eid="JHN 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>Ayhudni meya dey wolgire: «Inno neen ichcha woruniis Ha'oosta mei'ni kaama maketa boor'atano ma'a wostonesiktawa. Ne asu sinna faagedo teetneeson Ha'o zagitwa» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>Yesus dey ekka yi: «Nitto tumaassi ‹Ha'oos nittotin› ‹Koo'lowa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Han faadaasta futoni Ha'oosi eddenontu besifa</char></note>› yingwa yifar tichchera faartanoso? <verse eid="JHN 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/>Ese Ha'oosi korto matsafaason feeshuk aafawa chimtona wuza. Ha'oosi kaama yaana baassotin Ha'oosi kayma kaama ‹Nitto koo'lowa› yira teegenanneen; <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/>Eekin Abaas korto zagina barinnawa han daasta wosina barinna ‹Ta Ha'oni naawa› ubaasik awuni boor'a ‹Ha'oosta mei'ni kaama makewa› yifetiso? <verse eid="JHN 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/>Ta wostefana wostoos Abataasar sina shakaanane taan amanotiitawa. <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/>Sinuntano ta wostefana wostoos Abataasar sinfaanane taak amano beyfetiknu wostonaasik amanotiwa. Es barik Abaas tayissi feenamatonawa ta dey Abaasasi faanamatona mai'sira arsotiwa» <verse eid="JHN 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>Baasso dey hepsa ephonek sholsete; sinuntano bar kushubesiissin aatte kesse hami. <verse eid="JHN 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>Hepsa dey Yesus Yordanosni akaason finne zeemoti Yohannis haphqit feena dimaasta hamme esta di. <verse eid="JHN 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>Showo asuni meya barki yeesere: «Yohannis isa biistera artonoy wuzane aane zaguwe; sinuntano Yohannis han asusa chowanon makena wuzaas zuuttambaase futowa» yisesete. <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Estak dey showobesiis Yesusnik amanesete.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Alazarni Kitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1"/>Bitaniyak Alazar yiste isa asu mettere feer. Bitaniya Maaraminewa eetba Maartane feesefe ke'e. <verse eid="JHN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2"/>Es Maarami sinfa bar Daamiisa wochonon shitto woshshira dey sombaasik ku'a bar. Es mettees dey bari ay sina Alazar. <verse eid="JHN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>Eete eete dey: «Daamiiso! Es ne shunfata bar mettewa» yisere Yesuniki wosisete.<verse eid="JHN 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>Yesus es baron odenaase: «Han meroos barin woruni merotawa; sinuntano Ha'oosik ulfina sinanaknawa Ha'oosi naa dey han merosik ulfintonaknatu mettewa» yi.<verse eid="JHN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>Yesus Maartanon; eetba Maaraminonnawa aybesi Alazarninna shunar. <verse eid="JHN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Sinuntano Yesus Alazarni mettonon odefaat feena dimaasta hep wona feeshi. <verse eid="JHN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>Esseen orfo nawoni meyak: «Hepsa wolla Yuudaki daasta hamniwa» yi.<verse eid="JHN 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>Nawoni meya: «Assinynyano! Garo wonaneen sinak Ayhudni meya neen shu'ak ichonek sholset feeseterwa. Hepsa dey wolla esta hamatak sholetoso?» yisete.<verse eid="JHN 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>Yesus wolgire ekka yi: «Wonaassi asire heppe sa'atitanoso faari? Wonak kutife bar han daasi chaarefanon biidifer sinna boor'a aafawa tuusa'ona wuza. <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/>Sinuntano talmaassi kutife bar chaarefa barki aafa sinna boor'a tuusa'erwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>Es baron makenanneen orfo: «Zomoni sina Alazar afay'tewa. Sinuntano ta hamma afay'nitan barin guzgunarwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>Nawoni meya dey: «Daamiiso! Afay'nin kunir sinfaanane farunawa» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>Yesus Alazar kiti sinbaasontu baassok make. Sinuntano afay'nin kunnanne faar sinnatu baassok beste. <verse eid="JHN 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Es bari boor'a Yesus ammanon: «Alazar kitiwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/>Nitto amanotik esta fo beynaasik nittokwa iyaat girefawungwa. Sinuntano hash kabini barki hamniwa» yi.<verse eid="JHN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>Es kabaasik «Didimos» yistefe Tomas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tomas Ibirayistini kaamak «Mano» uu. Didimos Girikni kaamak: «Mano» uu.</char></note> oom nawoni meyak: «Kabini Yesusneen ane kitunik inno dey hamniwa» yi.<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Kitun Kabunewa Kaa Sinbaase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>Alazarni kituus kabbartenanneen acheech wona kar'faan Yesus ye. Asuni meya dey Alazar kitubaason Yesusnik maksete. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/>Bitaniya Yerusalemniistan wokbaas keez kiilo meetiri sinana. <verse eid="JHN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>Showo Ayhudni meya Maartanewa Maaramine asi aybesi kitifaan baassotin chinuk yeesere esta feeseter.<verse eid="JHN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Maarta Yesus yoobaason odenaase uphonak kesi. Sinuntano Maarami keer diifar. <verse eid="JHN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>Maarta Yesusnik: «Daamiiso! Ne hanta faatar sinfaanane aytaas kituna kabatawa. <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>Sinuntano hashnu ne Ha'ooskin shiiphefata baron zuutira neek imanamato arifawungwa» yi.<verse eid="JHN 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>Yesus dey barik: «Aynees kitun kabunawe» yi. <verse eid="JHN 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>Maarta dey: «Koi'baasi wono kitun kabuni kabaasik kabunamato arifawungwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>Yesus dey barik: «Kitun kabunewa kaane tawe. Taak amanefe bar kitifenaknu hayewtu sinana. <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/>Taak feefe barnawa taak amanefe barna zuuttere isanne aafa kituna wuza. Es baron amanefatose?» yi.<verse eid="JHN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>Bar dey: «Aa Daamiiso! Ne han daasta yooni Muudto Ha'oosi naa sintamato ta amanefawungwa» yi.<verse eid="JHN 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>Maarta es baron makefaat hamma eetbaason aachok teegera: «Assinynyaas yewe; neen dey sholediferwe» yi. <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>Maarami odenayse taptak kabira barki hami. <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>Es kabaasik Yesus Maarta uphena dimaastatu feeteno hashnu hang ke'e aane giruwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/>Baron chinuk barneen ane keer diise Ayhudni meya Maarami taptera kabi kesbaase Alazarni moogaaski hamma waasunak hamarne faar sinfaan orfobaase hamete.<verse eid="JHN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>Maarami Yesus feenaasta hamma biinayse wochobaassi gandera: «Daamiiso! Ne hanta faatar sinfaanane aytaas kituna kabatawa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>Yesus bar waasifeennawa barneen ane yeese Ayhudni meya waassefeen biyaat teetbaasiknu akamanon seektere suumere; <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>«Ayinso kunsitiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayinso kabbareti uwa.</char></note>?» yi. Baasso dey: «Daamiiso! Yaara biwa» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>Yesus arafa kessire waasi. <verse eid="JHN 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>Es bari boor'a Ayhudni meya: «Awune faaron shunfenamato biitiwa» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Sinuntano baassossin isa isaas: «Aaftishuusa aafanon fati bar han asus kitunoynamato zaguk aafanoso chimanawuza?» yisete.<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Alazarnin Kitun Kabgi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Yesus teetbaasik hepsa dey akamanon seektere suumefaat moogaaski hami. Moogaas dey inya shu'ak uktera kuni dugadug. <verse eid="JHN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>Yesus: «Shu'aason kabgutiwa» yi. Kiti basa eet Maarta: «Daamiiso! Kitinanneen acheech wona sinna boor'a hash zeyarwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>Yesus dey: « ‹Amanefaatane Ha'oosi ulfinanon biyatawe› yira neek aane makotose?» yi. <verse eid="JHN 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Asuni meya dey shu'aason kabugsete. Esseen orfo Yesus den kaanne: «Abataaso! Ta shiiphooson odeta boor'a galattefawungwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/>Wonna wonna dey shiiphonaason odefatamato arifawungwa. Sinuntano ekka makenaas ne taan wosuneeson han yerse asuni meya amanosonekwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>Yesus es baron makefaat: «Alazarno! Hang keswa» yire akama tega kaamak teege. <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>Kitu Alazar kushubaasewa wochobaase zuuttena eekobaase kesi. Sinbaas dey maamak taatena eekobaasetu fa. Yesus asuni meyak: «Kotaani kutuwowa» yi.<verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusnin Woruk Zagte Chowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Maaraminon chinuk yeese Ayhudni meyaassin showobesiis Yesus zagina baron biyefaat barik amanesete. <verse eid="JHN 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Sinuntano baassossin isa isaas Ferisawini meyaki hamere Yesus zagina baron maksete. <verse eid="JHN 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Es bari boor'a maagni gaanynye meenawa Ferisawini meena shonggosta zuuttesefe baassotin zuutisere: «Han asus showo biistera artonoy wuza zagidifer sinna boor'a awu zagaanine wayyanso? <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>Baak beyfaanine asu zuuttere barik amanonir; Roomni meya dey yeesere inno betemeqdesiisonnawa asuniisinna tishkiseseterwa» yisete.<verse eid="JHN 11:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>Sinuntano es woggaassik maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynya sina Qeyyaffa yistefe baassossin isaas: «Nitto isanne aane arifetiwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>Dara zuuttere tishubaastan isa asu daraasa teetak kitifaanane nittok ma'ar sinnamato aane yaadatefetinoso?» yi. <verse eid="JHN 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>Es baron dey makenaas basa teetaassin kisiretawa. Sinuntano es woggaassik bar maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynya sinna boor'a Yesus daraasa teetak kitunak feenamato besifena kabaasiktu es raajiison make. <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>Yesus daraasa teetak kitunaas Ayhudni daranik koi'ba sinnoynamato Ha'oosik amanera daadaassi siktera faase naanggotaason dey isarik zuutunakwa.<verse eid="JHN 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>Es wononeen kabsere Yesusnin woruk merkesete. <verse eid="JHN 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Es bari boor'a Yesus Ayhudni meeni ganeyaassi ammanon kesse aane kutuwe. Sinuntano essin kesse zaboosi tesha fa daa Efrem yistefa katamaassi hami. Estak dey nawoni meyaneen di.<verse eid="JHN 11:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Ayhudni meeni faasikani heeboos tai'sera faar. Showo asuni meya es heeboos kar'noyfeen zeemme masere kayimme hoorok feesefe daa daassin Yerusalem kesete. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>Yesusnin sholset feeseter sinna boor'a betemeqdesiissi yersefaat baassotna baassotna: «Awu safarefetiso? Han heeboosta yoonir sinna nittok aane bestefanoso?» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>Maagni gaanynye meenawa Ferisawini meena Yesusnin ephak bar feena dimaason arife asu feefaanane baassok makonak ajajesere feeseter.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Wochooson Maarami Shitto Woshshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>Ayhudni faasikani heeboos zagtonak issun wona fu'tefana kabaasik Yesus kitun kabgina Alazar feefena Bitaniya hami. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>Estak feese asuni meya meeta'u barik hoossisete. Maarta dey wostotatu fa. Alazar dey Yesusneen ane muu muusonek tai'sere feese baassossin isaaswa. <verse eid="JHN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/>Es kabaasik Maarami akama chima waagak waagte kayma naardosik wosuste isa buttulle shitto ephpha Yesusni wochoosta wuukaat sombaasik dey wochobaason ku'i. Keyaas dey naardosini shittoni sawak tuumi. <verse eid="JHN 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>Nawobaasasin isaas Yesusnin aatire imni Askorotki Yuuda ekka yi: <verse eid="JHN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>«Han shittoos isa wogga wosuste wostoni birrisi waagtera awuni boor'a tukamnik imto beyiso?» <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>Bar ekka yinaas tukamnik safarere sinnoynaron wiis sinna boor'awa. Waaga ephfees bar sinna boor'a kar'diddiissi ha'tefa barissin ephphe dostere feer. <verse eid="JHN 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>Yesus dey ekka yi: «Ashnaas kabbartona wonoti bariktu taan hoossi sinna boor'a beytiwa.» <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/>«Tukamni meya wonna wonna nittoneentu feesetewa. Sinuntano ta nittoneen wonna wonna aafa foona wuza.»<verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Es kabaasik showo Ayhudni meya Yesus Bitaniya foobaason odesefaat yeesete. Es yeesetees Yesus bar barin biya sinnoyanron kitun kabi Alazarninneen biyaktu yeesete. <verse eid="JHN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Sinuntano Maagni gaanynye meya Alazarnin dey woruk merkesete. <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>Esiis dey Alazarnistan kabi chowa Ayhudni meyaassin showobesiis Yesusnik amaneset feeseter sinna boor'a.<verse eid="JHN 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Akama Ulfinak Yerusalem Giri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>Wonotirik Ayhudni faasikani heeboosik ye showo dara Yesus Yerusalem yoonir sinbaason odesete. <verse eid="JHN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/>Es bari boor'a Deya kiir'e ephere barin uphok kesere: «Hosana! Daamiisa sunak yeefe Israelni taatoos suustowa» yit chaaget feeseter.<verse eid="JHN 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14"/>Yesus hanyani nawa danne barista di. Esiis dey:<verse eid="JHN 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15"/>«Ne Tsiyonni katama Yerusalemne digotaatawe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">esenu taatonees hanyani naata diire yoonir.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 12:15">yistera tichchewa.<verse eid="JHN 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>Nawoni meyak es chowaas zeemma baassok aane galowa. Sinuntano Yesus ulfintenanneen orfo es tichaas barik tichchenamatonawa barik zagtenamato yaadatesete. <verse eid="JHN 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Yesus Alazarnin moogaassin teegere kitun kabgifena kabaasik barneen ane fe asuni meya Yesusni chowaasik zaala makset feeseter. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/>Showo asuni meya uphok yeesetees es biistera artonoy wuzason zaginamato odesere feeseter sinna boor'awa. <verse eid="JHN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>Estan Ferisawini meya baassotna baassotna: «Han daasta fe asu zuuttambaase basa orfoose hamiwa! Inno isa wuzanu zaguk aane chimeni sinnamato biyetiyoso?» yisesete.<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Girikni Meya Yesusni Biyak Sholsete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Heeboosik Ha'oni shiiphok Yerusalem yeese baasso ganeyaassin isa isa Girikni asuni meya feeseter. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>Baasso dey Galiilaki Betesayidani asu sina Filiphosniki hamere: «Daamniiso! Yesusni biyanik sholefeniwa» yisete.<verse eid="JHN 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>Filiphoos hamme Indriyasnik make. Indriyasnawa Filiphosna hamere Yesusnik maksete. <verse eid="JHN 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>Yesus baassok wolgire ekka yi: «Asuni Naa ulfintona sa'atiis kar'iwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/>Futo futo nittok yifawungwa, isa zagoni gaana ho'aassi zigira kitu shakaanane bar bartu fui'tonirwa. Sinuntano kitira kayifaanane showo gaanatu gaanana. <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/>Kaabaason shunfe bar tishkir. Han daastak kaabaason oomtefe bar koi'ba foonto kaatu barin oodnir. <verse eid="JHN 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/>Taak wostok sholefe bar taneen ane yowo. Ta faanaasta wostinynyataas dey foona. Taak wostefe barin dey Abaas ulfinsuna.»<verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Basaasta Kar'ni Shanaasewa Kituse Asin Make</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>Tusire dey Yesus: «Hash kaanaason tiir'o ephiwa. Awu unarinso? ‹Abataaso! Han sa'atiisssin taan fu'aywa› unataaso? Sinuntano ekka unoynamato ta yaanay han shanani sa'atisikwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/>Abataaso! Ne sunneeson ulfinsuwa» yi. Esseen orfo saman: «Sunnaason ulfinsingwa, hepsa dey ulfinsunawa!» yifa kaama odte.<verse eid="JHN 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>Esta yere asuni meya es baron odefaat: «Dedowa» yisete. Oomiis dey: «Ha'oosi wosiyatu barik wollerwa» yisete.<verse eid="JHN 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>Yesus dey: «Es kaamaas odtenaas nittokwa iyaattano taaktawa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/>«Haye han daasi mangsuni kar'ni sa'atiis kar'iwa. Han daasi ha'sinynya sina Sexana gerakalo ha'tonaas hayewa. <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/>Ta han daastan den tegifana kabaasik asusin zuutira taaki yoonak zaguna» <verse eid="JHN 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>Yesus aro kitu kitunak feenamato besuktu es kaamaason make.<verse eid="JHN 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>Darani meya dey: «Inno tumaassi odeniis: ‹Kiristoos koi'ba foonto neya foonir› yifarwa. Eekin ne: ‹Asuni Naa den tegunak sholsifawa› yifataas aakkanso? Es Asuni Naas oonso?» yisete.<verse eid="JHN 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>Yesus dey: «Hash garo wona nittoneen ane chaarefaas faarwa. Talma nittotin ephnoynamato chaarefaas faana kabaasik kututi. Talmaassi kutife bar ay hamdifenamato aane arife. <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/>Nitto chaarefni naanggota sinotik chaarefaas faana kabaasik es chaarefaasik amanosotiwa» yi. Yesus es baron makenanneen orfo baassostan shaate.<verse eid="JHN 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayhudni Meeni Amano Beya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37"/>Yesus effatena showo biistera artonoy wuza baasso sina zagifenaknu Ayhudni meya barik aane amanosoto. <verse eid="JHN 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38"/>Es bar dey sinnaas raajju Isayyas: «Daamiiso! Oonso makeni kaamaason amaneri? Ha'oosi hugna dey oonik ammanon besteso?» yire makena kaamaas ko'unakwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39"/>Hepsa dey raajju Isayyas baasso amano beyaasik ekka yit ammanon make:<verse eid="JHN 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40"/>«Aaffesiisik biirenawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">nibbesiissi yaadaterena;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">wolsonoytematonawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">fatunoynamatona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">Ha'oos aaffesiison tishki;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">nibbesiison dey chini.»<verse eid="JHN 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>Isayyas han baron yinaas basa ulfinaason biina boor'awa. Es bari boor'a Yesusni chowaasik es baron make.<verse eid="JHN 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42-43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42-43"/>Sinfanaknu Ayhudni meyanon ha'sife baassossin showobesiis Yesusnik amanesete. Sinuntano Ha'ooskin bestefa ulfinaastan asunikin bestefa ulfinaason shunesete boor'a Ferisawini meya Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassin baassotin kalle kissonoytemato digsefaat amanobesiison ammanon aane maksoto.<verse eid="JHN 12:42-43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>Yesus kaambaason teggire ekka yi: «Taak amanefe bar taak koi'ba sinnoynaron taan wosi barik dey amanewa. <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/>Taan biya bar taan wosi barin dey biyanawa. <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/>Taak amanefe bar zuuttere talmaassi foonoynamato ta chaarefa sinna han daasta yaangwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/>Kaamnaason odere wostota feeshunoy basaasta mangsu kar'niis tatewa. Ta yaanaas han daason fu'oktano han daasta mangsuni kar'aktawa. <verse eid="JHN 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/>Taan ephphetoo beyye kaamnaason dey wostota feeshunoy basaasta mangsu kar'nir feerwa. Ta makena kaamaas koi'ni wono basaasta mangsu kar'anawa. <verse eid="JHN 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/>Ta taakin aane makotwa. Sinuntano ta una baronnawa makona ajajiisonna imaas taan wosi Abaaswa. <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/>Basa ajajiis dey koi'ba foonto kaa sinnamato arifawungwa. Es bari boor'a Abaas taak makena baron nittok makengwa.»<verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Nawobaasakitoni Wochonon Masi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>Wonaas dey Ayhudni faasikani heeboos zagtonoyfeen zeemmawa. Yesus han daason beyye den ababaaski hamana wona kar'baason ari. Han daasta fe basar sina baassotin shunet feer. Dey kituk kar'ananneen shuni.<verse eid="JHN 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>Yesusnawa basa nawoosna meeta'u meesedifer. Sinuntano Sexana Simonni naa Askorotki Yuudani nibaassi Yesusnin aatire imanak zagi. <verse eid="JHN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>Abaas ha'suni hugna zuuttambaase asin barik imnamatonawa Ha'ooskin yeenamatona; dey Ha'ooski wolle hamnir sinnamato Yesus arire feer. <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>Es bari boor'a meeta'ustan kabire tukaastaki mayna maamaason gaa'e kunsaat koyguni maama ephphe geshobaasta taar'e. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>Esseen orfo gabatesi aka gedde nawobaasakitoni wochonon masi. Taar'ena maamaasik dey ku'i. <verse eid="JHN 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>Simon Phexirosnin masak yeen bar dey: «Daamiiso! Ne ta wochooson masataroso?» yi. <verse eid="JHN 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>Yesus wolgire: «Ta zagifana baron ne hash aafawa aruta wuza. Sinuntano wolitu yaadatotawa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>Phexiros dey: «Ne ta wochooson isanne aafawa masata wuza!» yi. Yesus dey: «Wochoneeson masa shakaanane taakin haa'one aafawa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>Simon Phexiros dey: «Daamiiso! Ekka sinfaanane wochonaason koi'ba sinnoynaron kushunaasewa teetnaase asin gedda maswa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>Yesus dey: «Atubaason mase bar atuba zuuttera kayma sinna boor'a wochobaason masonaastano ooma aane sholsifawa. Nitto dey kayimwa. Sinuntano zuuttamnitiise kayimtewa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>Yesus: «Zuuttamnitiise kayimtewa» yinaas barin aatire imni bar oo sinnamato arire feer sinna boor'awa.<verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>Baasso wochooson masse kesnanneen orfo maybaason mayye wolle ukkoti diinaasta di. Ekka dey yi: «Ta awu zaginamato yaadatetiyoso? <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/>Nitto taan: ‹Assinynya wedey Daam› yisefeti. Ta assinynyanawa Daamna sinna boor'a es maketiis futowa. <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/>Ese ta nitto Daamnawa assinynyana sinfaat wochontiison masnanneen nitto dey nittotna nittotna wochontiison masotik sholsifawa. <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/>Ta nittok zaginaysimato nitto dey zagsotiktu beso nittok imingwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/>Futo nittok makefawungwa, wostinynya daambaasatan denalo aane sinfewa. Wostere hamfe bar dey barin wosi basaastan denalo aane sinfewa. <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/>Es baron arira wostota feeshaatine nitto suustowa. <verse eid="JHN 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/>Han baron makefanaas zuuttamnitiise asi chowatawa. Ta korina nittotin arifawungwa. Sinuntano korto matsafaassi: ‹Tushnaason taneen me bar guma sinne tayista kabiwa› yiste bar ko'unak sholsifawa. <verse eid="JHN 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/>Han bar sinnoyfeen zeemma nittok makenaas sinfana kabaasik ta Kiristoos sinnamato amanotikwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/>Futo futo nittok makefawungwa, ta wosina barin ephpheteefe bar taan dey ephphetoona. Taan ephphete bar dey taan wosi barin ephphetoona.»<verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusnin Aatire Imniis Oo Sinnamato Zeemme Make</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>Yesus es baron makenanneen orfo ayyanabaason tiir'o ephaan: «Futo futo nittok makefawungwa, nittoossin isaas taan aatire imnirwa» yit ammanon kisire make.<verse eid="JHN 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>Nawobaasakito ooni chowa makenamato aane arsoto sinna boor'a aafe aafe biyesete. <verse eid="JHN 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>Nawobaasakitonisin Yesus shunfena isa nawoos Yesusni tesha kasayere diifer. <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>Simon Phexiros es nawoosin aafa kiir'e: «Ooni chowa makenamato mamsibbo» yi.<verse eid="JHN 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>Bar dey ek Yesusniki tai'sere: «Daamiiso, oonso neen aatire imniri?» yit mamsi.<verse eid="JHN 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>Yesus dey wolgire: «Han tushaason utoossi dukira tuchuna barwa» yi. Estan tushaason utoossi dukire Askorotki Simonni naa sina Yuudanik tuchi. <verse eid="JHN 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>Yuuda tushaason ephnanneen orfo geregere Sexana basaassi giri. Yesus dey Yuudanin: «Ese zagutak sholeta baron tai'nin zaguwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Sinuntano esta muu muusonek kasayere diise baassossin es Yesus makefena bar awu sinnamato arir aafe. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>Yuuda waaga ephar sinna boor'a nawoni meyaassin isa isaas Yesus: «Heeboosik sholsu wuzason waagowa wedey tukamni meyak ima imma» yinanne faartu sinna baassok beste.<verse eid="JHN 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Yuuda dey es tushaason ephnanneen orfo geregere kesse hami. Es kabaasik dey waala.<verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gaddo Ajaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>Yuuda kesse hamnanneen orfo Yesus ekka yi: «Haye Asuni Naa ulfintewa. Ha'oos dey barki kamo ulfintewa. <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/>[Ha'oos barki kamo ulfintena boor'a Ha'oos dey barin ulfinsunawa. Geregere dey ulfinsunawa.] <verse eid="JHN 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/>Naanggotno! Akama wona nittoneen aane aafa foona wuza. Nitto dey taan sholsoti. Ayhudni ha'sinynyani meyak: ‹Ta hamana dimaassi nitto yootik aafa chimati wuza› yira makenaasimato hash nittok dey makefan. <verse eid="JHN 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/>Nittotna nittotna shunosotik gaddo ajaji nittok imana. Ta nittotin shunnaasimato nittotna nittotna dey shunosoti. <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/>Nittotna nittotna shunesefaatine ta nawo sinetimato asuni meya zuuttesere arsonewa.»<verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexiros Mormonamato Yesus Zeemme Make</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>Simon Phexiros Yesusnin: «Daamiiso! Ayinso hamatari?» yire mamsi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Yesus dey: «Hash ta hamana dimaassi ne yootak aafawa chimata wuza. Sinuntano woli yook chimatawa» yire wolgi.<verse eid="JHN 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>Phexiros dey: «Daamiiso! Hash ne orfoose yook chima beyanaas awuni boor'anso? Ta kaanaasonnu sinun neekwa iyaat aatira imanawa» yi.<verse eid="JHN 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>Yesus ekka yire barik wolgi: «Kaaneeson taakwa iyaat aatira imataro? Futo futo neek makefawungwa, ako oorunoyfeen keeza wolla taan mormotawa.»<verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Den Abaaski Taamni Ugna Yesuswa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>Yesus ekka yi: «Nibnitiis nawonaata, Ha'oosik amanoti. Taak dey amanoti. <verse eid="JHN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/>Showo fooni dima Abataasa keeruk faar. Ekka sina shakaanane: ‹Footi dima nittok hoossunak hamanarwa› yira nittok makona kabatawa. <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/>Hamma footi dima hoossinanneen orfo ta faanaasta nitto dey footik hepsa wolla yaara nittotin ephpha hamana. <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/>Ta hamana dimaassi zoonsuni ugnaason dey arsetir.»<verse eid="JHN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>Tomas: «Daamiiso! Ne hamata dimaason aane aruweniwa. Eekin ugnaason aakkak arunisso?» yi. <verse eid="JHN 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>Yesus dey Tomasnik: «Abaaski zoonsuni ugunnewa futone dey kaane tawa. Taaki kamo sina shakaanane oonu Abaaski hamnir aafewa. <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/>Taan arseti sinfaanane Abataasin dey arutiwa. Sinuntano hawungneen ekalo arsotiwa. Dey biyetiwa» yi.<verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>Filiphoos dey: «Daamiiso! Abaasin besuwa; innok hooronawa» yi.<verse eid="JHN 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>Yesus wolgire: «Filiphosno! Effatena wona nittoneen ane faana taan aane aruwenoso? Taan biya bar Abaasin biwa. Eekin aakkak ne: ‹Abaasin innok besuwa› yifasso? <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/>Ta Abaasasi faanamato, Abaas dey tayissi feenamato aane amanefenoso? Ta nittok makefana kaamaas ta teetaaskintawa. Sinuntano wostobaason wostefees tayissi feefe Abaaswa. <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/>Ta Abaasasi faanamato, Abaas dey tayissi feenamato taak amanotiwa. Es baron shakaatine wostena wostonaasi boor'a taak amanoti. <verse eid="JHN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/>Futo futo nittok makefawungwa, ta Abaaski hamanar sinna boor'a taak amanefe bar ta wostefana wostooson dey wostona. Es baristan denalonontu wostona. <verse eid="JHN 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/>Abaas Naabaaski kamo ulfintonak ta sunaasik shiiphefeti shiiphooson zuuttambaase ta nittok zaguna. <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/>Aaffa wuzasonnu ta sunaasik shiiphefaatine ta zaguna.<verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Korto Ayyanaasi Chowak Imna Abdi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>«Taan keeshtetir sinfaanane ajajinaason oodtiwa. <verse eid="JHN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16"/>Ta Abaasin shiiphonawa. Bar dey koi'ba foontonon nittoneen ane fooni ooma nittotin chinuni baron imana. <verse eid="JHN 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17"/>Es bar dey futoni Ayyanaaswa. Han daas biyaknawa arunakna aafa chimanawuza sinna boor'a ephphetook aafa chimanawuza. Sinuntano bar nittoneen ane faar dey nittoossi foonir sinna boor'a nitto aruti.<verse eid="JHN 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/>«Ababa intoba foonto naanggotaasne faaron zagira nittotin aafa beyana wuza. Ta nittoki wolla yoonar. <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/>Garo wonaneen orfo han daas taan aafa biyana wuza. Sinuntano hepsa wolla nitto taan biyati. Ta hayew sinna boor'a nitto dey hayew sinati. <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/>Ta Abaasasi faanamato, nitto dey tayissi faatimato, ta dey nittoossi faanamato es wono arsoti.<verse eid="JHN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/>«Taan keeshtefe bar ajajinaason ephpheteere wostota feeshife barwa. Abataas dey taan keeshtefe barin keeshtona. Ta dey barin keeshtona. Teetnaason dey barik ammanon besuna.»<verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>Askorotki Yuuda sinnoy oom Yuuda: «Daamiiso! Han daasi asunik sinnoynaron innok teetneeson ammanon besutaas aakkakinso?» yi.<verse eid="JHN 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>Yesus wolgire ekka yi: «Taan keeshtefe bar kaamnaason oodar. Abataas dey barin keeshtona. Inno dey barki yaara barneen ane fooni. <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/>Taan keeshtonoy bar kaamnaason aane oodfe. Han odefeti kaamaas taan wosi Abaasartano taartawa.<verse eid="JHN 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>«Nittoneen ane faana kabaasik han baron nittok maken. <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/>Sinuntano Abaas ta sunaasik wosuna nittotin chinuni Korto Ayyanaas zuuttambaase asin assuna. Ta nittok makena baron yaadatotik nittotin zaguna.<verse eid="JHN 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/>«Nagaason nittok beyanawa. Naganaason nittok imana. Ta nittok imana nagaas han daas imfana barne faartawa. Nibnitiis nawonaata dey digonaata. <verse eid="JHN 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/>‹Ta hamanar, wolla dey nittoki yoonar› yira makena baron odeseti. Taan keeshtetir sinfaanane Abaas tayistan arkir sinna boor'a ta Abataaski hamnaasik girsoti kabawa. <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/>Es bar sinfana kabaasik amanosotik zeemma nittok makengwa. <verse eid="JHN 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/>Han daason ha'sife Sexaniis yoonir sinna boor'a hawungneen ekalo akamanon nittoneen aafa wollona wuza. Bar tayista isa wuza zaguna hugnaba aafa. <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/>Sinuntano ta Abaasin keeshtefanamato han daas arunak Abaas taan ajajena baron zuutira zagunarwa. Hantan kabini hamniwa» yi.<verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Wayiniisi Tuzwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>Tusire dey: «Ta wayiniisi tuzanimatowa. Es wayiniison oodfees Abataaswa. <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/>Gaana gaannoy tayista fa waay'aason zuutire kar'e ha'unir. Gaana gaanfa waay'aason dey fanire mai'sira gaananak oodana. <verse eid="JHN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/>Nitto ta makena kaamaasik kayim sinetiwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/>Taneen ane footi. Ta dey nittoneen ane foona. Waay'aas wayiniisi tuzta fo shakaanane teetbaasik bar bar gaana gaanak aafa chimanawuza. Esiisimato nitto dey taneen ane fo shakaatine gaana gaanatik aafa chimati wuza.<verse eid="JHN 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>«Ta wayinisikitoni tuzatowa. Nitto dey bari waay'awa. Taneen ane feefe barnawa ta dey barneen ane faana barnatu akama gaana gaannirwa. Ta foontonon isa wuzane zaguk aafa chimati wuza. <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/>Taneen ane foonoy bar waay'asimato gerakalo ha'tere ichimana. Es Waay'aas dey kephtera geesi ha'tera kiichchona. <figure style="fig" alt="Branch of vine" file="HK00112B.tif" size="span" ref="15:1-6">Wayinini gamduusi fasha</figure><verse eid="JHN 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/>«Tayissi faasefaatinenawa kaamnaas dey nittoossi faafaananena sholeti wuzason zuutira shiiphefaatine danati. <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/>Akama gaana gaanna ta nawo sinefaatine es barik Abataas ulfintona. <verse eid="JHN 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/>Abaas taan keeshtenaasimato ta dey nittotin keeshtonawa. Es bari boor'a ta keeshtanaasik foosoti. <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/>Ta Abataasa ajajinon zaginamatonawa keeshtanbaasik faafanamatona nitto dey ajajinaason zagifaatine ta keeshtanaasik foosoti. <verse eid="JHN 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/>Han baron nittok makenaas ta giraas nittoossi foonaknawa nitto giraas dey tuuma sinanakwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/>Ta ajajiis haniis: ta nittotin keeshtenaasimato nitto dey wal keeshtosotikwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/>Asu kaabaason zomobaasikwa iyaat aatire imaastan denalo keeshtana aafawa. <verse eid="JHN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/>Nitto dey ta ajajena baron zagifaatine ta zomowa. <verse eid="JHN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/>Wostinynyaas daambaas zagifena baron aane arife sinna boor'a hawungneen ekalo nittotin wostinynyata aafa unawuza. Sinuntano Abataaskin odena baron zuuttambaase nittok maken sinna boor'a zomota yingwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/>Tatu nittotin korirteno nitto taan aane koruwetiwa. Hamma akama gaana gaanotik, gaannitiis dey foonak ta nittotin taassingwa. Es bari boor'a Abaas ta sunaasik shiipheti wuzason zuutire imana. <verse eid="JHN 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/>Ese ta nittotin ajajefanaas nittotna nittotna wal keeshtosotikwa.<verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Han Daas Oomtonamato Make</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>«Han daas nittotin oomtefaanane nittoostan zeemma taan oomtenamato aruti. <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/>Han daastaki asuni meenimato sineti sinfaatine barir sina baassotin shunana kabawa. Sinuntano nitto han daasir sina beyti boor'anawa ta nittotin han daasi asunisin korina boor'anatu han daas nittotin oomtefa. <verse eid="JHN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/>‹Wostinynyaas Daambaasatan denalo aane sinfewa› yira nittok makena baron gasasuti. Taan shanasi gedak kalle kofuksetenneen nittotin dey shanasi gedak kalle kofukseterwa. Kaamaason odesefaatene nitto kaamaason dey odosonewa. <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/>Sinuntano taan wosi barin aane arsefe sinna boor'a han baron zuutire taar sinti boor'a nittoosta zagsone. <verse eid="JHN 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/>Ta yaara baassok mako shakin sinfaanane baassosta boor'a sinana kabatawa. Sinuntano hash boor'besiisik maksone wuza aafawa. <verse eid="JHN 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23"/>Taan oomtefe bar Abataasin dey oomter. <verse eid="JHN 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24"/>Oom asu wostonoyna wostooson baasso ganeyaassi wosto shakin sinfaanane baassosta boor'a sinana kabatawa. Sinuntano hash han baron zuutire biyetinneen orfo taneen Abataasinneen oomtesete. <verse eid="JHN 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/>Esiis dey sinnaas baasso tumaassi: ‹Shimaasiktu taan oomtesete› yistera tichche kaamaas ko'unakwa.<verse eid="JHN 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>«Sinuntano Abaaskin yooni barewa ta dey nittoki wosuna chinuni futoni Korto Ayyanaase yaara ta chowaasik zaala makona. <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/>Nitto dey zeemmaneen taneen ane faasetir sinna boor'a ta chowaasik zaala maksoti.<verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>Han baron nittok makenaas amantontiis tuusa'onoynamatowa. <verse eid="JHN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/>Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassin nittotin kalle kissone. Es baristan denalo dey nittotin wori bar zuuttambaase Ha'oosik wostesetenne faaron sinna faadtona wona yoona. <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/>Abaasin wedey taan aane arsoto sinna boor'atu es baron ekka zagsefe. <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/>Sinuntano han baron nittok makenaas es wonaas kar'fana kabaasik ta awu nittok makenamato yaadatotikwa. Nittoneen ane faana boor'atu han baron zuutira zeemma nittok mako beyingwa.<verse eid="JHN 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Korto Ayyanaas Wostona Wosto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/>«Sinuntano hash taan wosi barki hamanar. Nittoossin dey: ‹Ay hama?› yire taan mamsunir aafe. <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/>Sinuntano han baron nittok makena boor'a nibnitiis suumok tuumi. <verse eid="JHN 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/>Sinuntano futooson nittok makefawungwa, ta hamaas nittok ma'arwa. Ta hama shakaanane chinuni korto Ayyanaas nittoki aafa yoonawuza. Sinuntano ta hamfaanane chinuni korto Ayyanaason nittok wosuna. <verse eid="JHN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/>Bar yaara han daason boor'ni chowaasik, ookoni chowaasik, mangsuni kar'ni chowaassik wee'ona. <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/>Taak amano beyobesiisiktu boor'ni chowaasik wee'ona. <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/>Ta Abaaski hamanar sinna boor'anawa hawungneen ekalo dey taan aafa biyati wuza sinna boor'anatu ookoni chowaasik wee'ona. <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/>Han daason ha'sife basaasta mangsu katena boor'atu mangsuni kar'ni chowaassik wee'ona.<verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>«Nittok makona wuza akama faar. Sinuntano hash nittoosta fayar. <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/>Futo sina Ha'oosi chowanon ammanon kisira besuni Ayyanaas yaafana kabaasik futo zuuttambaase asiissi nittotin zoosuna. Bar odefana barontu nittok makonatano bari teetaassin kisira aafa makona wuza. Dey yooni wuzasikitonon nittok makona. <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/>Bar taar sina baristantu epha nittok makona sinna boor'a taan ulfinsuna. <verse eid="JHN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/>Abaasar sina bar zuuttera taar. Es bari boor'atu: ‹Taar sina baristantu epha nittok makona› yinwa.<verse eid="JHN 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Suumontiis Girak Sooltona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>«Garo wonaneen orfo taan aafa biyati wuza; dey garo wonaneen orfo hepsa taan biyati.»<verse eid="JHN 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>Nawobaasakitonisin isa isaas baassotna baassotna: « ‹Abataaski dey hamanar sinna boor'a garo wonaneen orfo taan aafa biyati wuza; Dey garo wonaneen orfo hepsa taan biyati› yifenaas aambanso?» yisesete. <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>«Ese han ‹Garo wonaneen orfo› yifena wuzaas aambanso? Makefena wuzason aane galowa» yisesete.<verse eid="JHN 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>Yesus dey barin mamsuk sholsetemato arifaat ekka yi: «Nittotna nittotna ‹Garo wonaneen orfo taan aafa biyatiwuza; Dey garo wonaneen orfo taan biyati› yina boor'anoso wal mamussefetiis? <verse eid="JHN 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/>Futo nittok makefawungwa, nitto chaaga waasuti. Sinuntano han daasi asuni meya girsone. Nitto suumoti, sinuntano suumontiis girak sooltona. <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/>Mashka asu kophoni keektoni wonbaas kar'fana kabaasik suumefa. Sinuntano nawa kooninanneen orfo han daasta nawa koontena boor'a girabaastan kabi chowa aata shanabaason aane yaadatefa. <verse eid="JHN 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/>Esiisimato nitto hash suumotir, sinuntano hepsa wolla nittotin biyanar. Nibnitiis dey girona. Es girantiison dey nittoostan ephnir aafe.<verse eid="JHN 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/>«Es wono taakin isa wuzane aafa shiiphoti wuza. Futo nittok makefan, Abaas ta sunaasik shiiphsefeti wuzason zuutire nittok imana. <verse eid="JHN 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/>Hashneen kar'a ta sunaasik isa wuzane aane shiiphoweti. Girantiis tuuma sinanak shiiphoti danati.<verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>«Esseen hawung besoktu nittok maken. Hanneen besok makonoyna wona yoona. Sinuntano Abaasa chowanon nittok ammanon makona. <verse eid="JHN 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/>Es wono ta sunaasik shiiphoti. Ta dey: ‹Abaasin nittok shiiphonawa› aafa unawuza. <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/>Esiis dey Abaas teetbaasik nittotin shunar. Bar dey shunfenaas taan shunti boor'anawa Ha'ooskin yoonaason amaneseti boor'anawa. <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/>Abaaskin kessa han daasta yaan. Hepsa dey han daason beyya Abataaski hamanar.»<verse eid="JHN 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>Nawobaasakito dey: «Haye besok sinnoynaron ammanon maketwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>Zuuttambaase aritar sinna boor'a oonu neen mamsunak aane sholsifa sinnamato haye ariniwa. Es bar dey ne Ha'ooskin yaatamato amanonik zagiwa» yisete.<verse eid="JHN 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>Yesus ekka yire baassok wolgi: «Futoosik haye amanetiyoso? <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/>Ese isa isarnitiis siktera keenti keenti hamati wonaasewa ta taan beyoti wonaase yoona. Es sa'atiis dey haye kar'iwa. Sinuntano Abaas taneen ane feena boor'a tatatewa. <verse eid="JHN 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/>Han baron nittok makenaas taneen ane faafaani naga nittok foonakwa. Han daasta faafeti kabaasik shana nittok faar. Sinuntano harewa! Ta han daason merengwa.»<verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Nawobaasakitonik Shiiphe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>Yesus es baron makenanneen orfo sama biire ekka yi: «Abataaso! Haye wonaas kar'iwa. Ta ne Naas neen ulfinsunak Naaneesin ulfinsuwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/>Esiis dey asu zuuttambaase asiista ha'suni hugna imta boor'a barik imta baasso zuuttambesiise asik koi'ba foonto kaa imanak barin ulfinsutawa. <verse eid="JHN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/>Koi'ba foonto kaas dey ne ne futoni Ha'o sinnesonnawa wosita Yesus Kiristoosninna aruwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/>Ne taak imta wostooson wostera koi'sira han daastak neen ulfinsingwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/>Abataaso! Han daas testonoyfeen ne faataasta faana kabaasik fa ulfinaaski wolgira taan ulfinsuwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>«Han daastan korira taak imta baassok ne oo sintamato besingwa. Baasso dey neerwa. Ne dey baassotin taak imitwa. Baasso dey kaamneeson oodesete. <verse eid="JHN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/>Taak imta bar zuuttera neekin sinnamato baasso haye arsete. <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/>Ne taak maketa kaamaason baassok maken. Baasso dey ephpheteesete. Ta neekin yaanamato dey futok arsete. Ne taan wositamato dey amanesete.<verse eid="JHN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/>«Ne taak imanak imta nawoni meya neer sinete boor'atu shiiphefantano han daasiktawa. <verse eid="JHN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/>Taar sina baasso zuuttere neerwa. Neer sina baasso dey taarwa. Ta dey baassoktu ulfintona. <verse eid="JHN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/>Hawungneen ekalo ta han daastak aafa foona wuza. Sinuntano baasso han daastatu foosone. Ta neeki yoonar. Korto Abataaso! Han taak imanak imta baassotin innomato isar sinonek ne taak imta sunneesik oodwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/>Baassoneen ane faana kabaasik baassotin ne sunaasik oodin; imanak taak imta baassotin dey oodin. Tichaasi kaama ko'unak tishuni naasteno baassossin oonu aane tishuwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/>Haye neeki yoonar. Ta giraas baassok tuuma sinanak han daastak faana kabaasik han baron makengwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/>Ta kaamneeson baassok maken. Ta han daastakir sina beynasimato baasso dey han daastakirtewa. Es bari boor'a han daas baassotin oomte. <verse eid="JHN 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/>Baassotin mangu sina bariissin oodataktano han daastan gero kisutak aafa shiiphona wuza. <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/>Ta han daastakir sina beynasimato baasso dey han daastakirtewa. <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/>Futoosik baassotin korto zaguwa. Kaamnees futowa. <verse eid="JHN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/>Ne taan han daasta fe asuski wositaasimato ta dey baassotin wosin. <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/>Baasso futok ne wostoosik teetbesiison aatire imonek ta ta teetaason maa'a zagira baassok imingwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>«Baasso kaamaasi boor'a taak amanefe baassokneentu shiiphedifantano nawotaasakitonik koi'batawa. <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/>Ta shiiphefanaas zuuttambesiise isar sinonekwa. Es barik ne taan wositamato han daas dey amanona. Esiis dey Abataaso! Ne tayissi faatamato ta dey neyissi faanamato baasso dey innoossi foosonekwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/>Inno isar sinniisimato baasso dey isar sinonek ne taak imta ulfinaason baassok imin. <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/>Futok isar sinonees dey ta baassossi ne tayissi faatamatowa. Es barik ne taan wositamatonawa taan keeshtetaasne faaron baassotin dey keeshtetamatona han daas arunakwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>«Abataaso! Han daas testonoyfeen taan keeshteta boor'a ne taak imta ulfinaason biyonek han ne taak imta baasso dey ta faanaasta taneen ane foosonek sholefan. <verse eid="JHN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/>Ooko Abataaso! Han daas neen aane aruwa. Sinuntano ta neen arinar. Han baasso dey ne taan wositamato arsete. <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/>Ne taan keeshteta keeshtanaas baassossi dey sinanaknawa ta dey baassossi foonakna baasso dey neen arsonek zagin. Dey arsonek zaguna.»<verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Aattere Imte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>Yesus es baron shiiphenanneen orfo nawobaasakitoneen ane Kedironni kophaasi yesalo hami. Yesusnawa nawobaasakitona akakiltiisi girsete. <verse eid="JHN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>Yesusnawa nawobaasakitona showo wona esta zuutteseter sinna boor'a aatire ima Yuuda es dimaason arir. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>Es bari boor'a Yuuda showo meya taar'oni meeni zuuttoneen dey maagni gaanynye meyakinnawa Ferisawini meyakinna wostere yeese oodfe baasso ha'sinynyani meyanonna zoonsire esta hami. Baasso dey faanosi, tonanewa neeboni meene ephaat feeseter. <verse eid="JHN 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>Yesus dey basaasta kar'ni baron zuuttambaase arifaat baassoki hamme: «Oonininso sholetiri?» yi. <verse eid="JHN 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>Baasso dey: «Naaziretki Yesusnintu sholefeniwa» yisete. Bar dey: «Tawa» yi. Aatire ima Yuuda dey baassoneen ane yerefer. <verse eid="JHN 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>Yesus: «Tawa» ubaase orfobesiisik hamere daasta gandesete. <verse eid="JHN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>Yesus hepsak dey: «Oonininso sholetiri?» yire mamsi. Baasso dey: «Naaziretki Yesusninwa» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>Bar dey: «Tawa yinaaskaso; ese sholefetiis taan sinfaanane han taneen ane feese baassotin beyfaani hamotowa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>Es bar dey sinnaas: «Abataaso! Han taak imta baassossin isarinnu aane tishkutwa» yina kaamaas ko'unakwa.<verse eid="JHN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Simon Phexiros kutesiko ephphe feer sinna boor'a kisire maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaasa wostinynyani oi'ta odonon kace. Wostinynyaasa suna dey Malkos. <verse eid="JHN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/>Sinuntano Yesus Phexirosnin: «Kutesikoneeson zanbaassi wolgira gedwa. Abaas taak imna shanani ushaason aafa ushana wuzane faar sinna neek bestefawoso?» yi.<verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Maagiisa Gaannye Meeni Gaanynyaasa Sina Haannaniki Tai'se</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>Esseen orfo meya taar'osneen baassotin ajajefe baassoneennawa Ayhudni meeni tasoni meeni ha'sinynyani meena Yesusnin ephere taar'ete. <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>Zeemme Haannaniki ephphe hamete. Es neyaasik Haanna maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynya sina Keyyaffanik naashba. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/>Keyyaffa: «Daraasa teetak isa asu kitifaanane ma'arwa» yire Ayhudni meyanon ha'sife baassok zeemo sinak mekama ima asu.<verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexiros Yesusnin Morme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>Simon Phexiros oom nawoosna Yesusni orfoose hamete. Es oom nawoos dey maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaasik arto. Es bari boor'a bar maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyani ojni keerkalo Yesusneen ane giri. <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/>Sinuntano Phexiros gerakalo ojaasi finynyini tesha yerefer. Maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaasik arto nawoos kesse keyaason oodfa mashka wostinynyaasik makere Phexirosnin keerkalo gedi. <verse eid="JHN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Es keyaason oodfa mashka wostinynyaas Phexirosnin: «Ne dey han asusa nawoosasin isaastenoso?» yi. Bar wolgire: «Indaanewe» yi.<verse eid="JHN 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Gerok koocho sinna boor'a wostinynyani meenawa oodfe baasso ha'sinynya kaa'oni geya sookere yersefaat bessedifer. Phexiros dey baassoneen ane yerefaat besidifer.<verse eid="JHN 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Maagni Gaanynye Meeni Gaanynyaas Yesusnin Mamsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>Es kabaasik maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaas Yesusnin nawobaasakitoni chowanonnawa basa assuse asin mamsi. <verse eid="JHN 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>Yesus dey ekka yit wolgi: «Ta han daa zuuttambaase asik ammanontu maken. Ayhudni meya zuuttambesiise zuuttesefe Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassik sinun wedey betemeqdesiissi wonna wonna assin. Aachok isa wuzane aane makot. <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/>Eekan awuniron taan mamsifatso? Makefana kabaasik ode baassotin mamsuwa. Ta makena baron baasso arseterwa.»<verse eid="JHN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Yesus es baron makefena kabaasik esta yere oodfe baasso ha'sinynyaasasin isaas: «Maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaasik ekka yitnoso wolgutari?» yit Yesusnin bochi.<verse eid="JHN 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>Yesus dey: «Mangu kaama maken sinfaanane es makena barik zaal sinna makowa. Makena bar futo sinfaanane awuni boor'a taan ichfasso?» yi.<verse eid="JHN 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>Estan Haanna Yesusnin taatobaase wolgire maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynya sina Keyyaffaniki gafki.<verse eid="JHN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexiros Hepsak Dey Yesusnin Morme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>Simon Phexiros yerefaat geya besidifer. Oom asuni meya dey: «Ne han asusa nawoosasin isaastenoso?» yisete. Bar dey: «Indaanewa» yit morme.<verse eid="JHN 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>Phexiros odobaason kacena basa koon sina maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaasa wostinynyaasasin isaas: «Atakiltini dimaassi Yesusneen ane feen aane biyutoso?» yi.<verse eid="JHN 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>Phexiros dey hepsa wolle morme; es kabaasik geregere ako oori.<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Philaxosni Eina Ta'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>Esseen orfo e'so wonsak Yesusnin Keyyaffani keerun ephere daa ha'sife Philaxosni ojni keerkalo taamete. Ayhudni meya faasikani heeboosi meeta'unon muusonek sholsu sinna boor'a kiinonoytemato uuk daa ha'sife basa ojni keerkalo aane girsoto. <verse eid="JHN 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>Es bari boor'a daa ha'sife bar gero kesse: «Han asusata malateti malataas aambanso?» yit baassotin mamsi. <verse eid="JHN 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>Baasso dey wolgire: «Han asus mangu wuza zagu shaki sinfaanane aatira neek imani kabatawa» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>Pilatos dey: «Nitto ephpha hamfaat tumantiisimato basaasta mangsu kar'tiwa» yi. Ayhudni meya dey: «Inno tumaasik asunin woru kaltowa» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/>Es bar dey sinaas Yesus aro kitu kitunamato makena kaamaas ko'unakwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>Pilatos hepsa wolle ojni keerkalo giri. Yesusnin barki teegsire: «Ne Ayhudni meeni taatonoso?» yit mamsi. <verse eid="JHN 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>Yesus wolgire: «Han ne makefata bar neekiningwa wedey oom asuni meya ta chowaason neek makseterinso?» yi. <verse eid="JHN 18:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>Pilatos wolgire: «Ta Ayhudnoso? Neen taak aatire imaas ne keen sinna baassonawa maagni gaanynyaasnawa. Ne awu mangsisso?» yi. <verse eid="JHN 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>Yesus wolgire: «Ta taatoos han daastakirtawa; taatonaas han daastakir sini sinfaanane Ayhudni ha'sinynyani meeni kushusi aattera imtonoynamato ta meya taar'oni meya neebsone kabawa. Sinuntano ta taatoos han daastakirtawa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>Pilatos wolgire: «Ne eekin taatonoso?» yi. Yesus dey: «Ta taato sinnamato nenu maketwa. Ta koontenaasewa han daasta yaanaase futooson asuni meyak makonakwa. Futooskin sina bar zuuttere kaamnaason odonawa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 18:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>Pilatos wolgire: «Futo aambanso?» yire mamsi. Estan Pilatos hepsa Ayhudni meyaki kesse: «Ta isa mangsune basaastan aane danut. <verse eid="JHN 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/>Sinuntano faasikani heeboosik isa taatonin ta nittok kotana bar artowa. Es bari boor'a Ayhudni meeni taatosin nittok kotanak sholefetiyoso?» yi. <verse eid="JHN 18:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>Sinuntano baasso zuuttambesiise: «Barbaannintu kotatatano Yesusnintawa!» yiset chaagete. Barbaan dey bo'inynya.<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Meya Taar'osakito Yesusnin Kanyesete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>Esseen orfo Pilatos Yesusnin ichshi. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/>Meya taar'obaasakito dey seer'ani zawudi ma'ire teetbaasta guufsaat wayintajji maya mayissesete. <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>Barki yeesefaafe: «Ayhudni taatooso! Naga neek sinfawungwa» yiset bochet feeseter. <verse eid="JHN 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>Pilatos hepsa gero kesse baassok: «Esenu isa mangsu basaastan aane danut sinnamato arutik barin nittok gero kissunawa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Yesus seer'ani zawudi guufere wayintajji maya mayye gerakalo kesi. Pilatos: «Ese asus hanifewa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>Maagni gaanynye meenawa taar'oni meeni ha'sinynyaasna biyere: «Suutwa! Suutwa!» yiset chaagesete. Sinuntano Pilatos: «Ta isa mangsune basaastan aane danutwa. Nitto ephpha taamfaat suuttiwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Ayhudni meya wolugsere: «Inno tumani faarwa; han asus bar barin wolgire: ‹Ta Ha'oni naa› yina boor'a es tumaniisimato kitunaktu sholsifawa» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>Pilatos es baron odenayse akamanon dige. <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>Wolle ojaasi keerkalo girifaat Yesusnin: «Ne ayininso yaatari?» yire mamsi. Sinuntano Yesus isa wuzane aane wolguwe. <verse eid="JHN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>Pilatos dey: «Taak aane makefenoso? Ta neen kotanak wedey suutanak ha'suni hugnana faanamato aane aruwenoso?» yi. <verse eid="JHN 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>Yesus dey: «Ha'ooskin ha'suni hugna neek imto shaki sinfaanane ne tayista isa hugnane aafawa. Taan neek aatire ima asus akama boor'ba faarwa.»<verse eid="JHN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusniista Kituni Mangsu Kate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>Pilatos es baro odenayse Yesusnin kotak shole. Sinuntano Ayhudni meya: «Han barin kotaatane ne Qeesarni keentewa. Teetbaason taato zagi bar zuuttere Keesarni gumawa» yiset chaagete. <verse eid="JHN 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>Pilatos es baron odere Yesusnin gerakalo kisaat: «Yiito shu'a» yistefa dimaasta mangsuni kar'ni kodaasta di. Es dimaas Ibrayistini noonok «Gabata» yisteratu teegtefa. <verse eid="JHN 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>Faasikani heeboosi hooroni wona sinna faar. Wonaas dey issun sa'ati sinana. Es kabaasik Philatos Ayhudni meyak: «Hanifewa taatontiis» yi. <verse eid="JHN 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>Sinuntano baasso: «Tishkuwa! Tishkuwa! Suutwa!» yit chaagesete. Pilatos wolgire: «Taatontiisin suutanaroso?» yi. Maagni gaanynye meya: «Keesarteno oom taatoni aafewa» yit wolugsete. <verse eid="JHN 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Es kabaasik Pilatos Yesusnin suuttonak aatire imi. Baasso dey Yesusnin ephphe hamete. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus on the cross" file="LB00324B.tif" size="span" ref="19:17">Yesus masqaliista </figure><verse eid="JHN 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Suutto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>Yesus mesqeliison wor'e: «Teetni mega» yistefa dimaasta kesi. Es dimaas Ibrawini meeni noonok: «Golgotatu» yistefa. <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>Esta taamme suutete. Barneen ane oom hep asunin; isaasin aldaasta; isaasin hoi'taasta; Yesusnin ganeyaassi zagire suutete. <verse eid="JHN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>Pilatos dey: «Naaziretki Yesus Ayhudni taato» yifa ticha tichisere mesqeliisi teetta yeeti. <verse eid="JHN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Yesus suuttena dimaas Yerusalemni katamaasik ta'a sinna boor'a showo Ayhudni meya es tichaason feretisete. Tichaas dey tichchenaas Ibrayistini meeni noonok; Roomni meeni noonoknawa Girikni meeni noonoknatu tichche. <verse eid="JHN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Ayhudni maagni gaanynye meya Philaxosnin: «Ne ‹Ayhudni meeni taatowa› yira tichutaatawa. Sinuntano han asus: ‹Ta Ayhudni meeni taatowa› yi yiratu tichutawa» yisete. <verse eid="JHN 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>Pilatos: «Tichina baron tichingwa» yire wolgi. <verse eid="JHN 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>Meya taar'osakito Yesusnin suutetenneen orfo maybaason isarba isarbaasik isa kushu kar'anak acheech dimta bagesete. Gaag mayooson dey ephete. Es gaag mayoos denun kabira yeet kar'a shimanonik wichertano zootterta. <verse eid="JHN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/>Es bari boor'a meya taar'osakito baassotna baassotna: «Oonik kar'nitto arunik ixxa ha'uniistano aafa karasuni wuza» yisesete. Esiis dey sinnaas:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">«Maynaason baassotna baassotna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">Haa'esete;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">maynaasta ixxa ha'sesete.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:24">Yifa tichaasi kaama ko'unak sinna boor'a meya taar'osakito dey ekka zagsete. <verse eid="JHN 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Yesus suuttena mesqeliisi teshta intobaasewa intobaasi eetne; Kilopani asu Maaraminewa Magdelawitki Maaramine esta yersefar. <verse eid="JHN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Yesusni intoos bar shunfena nawoosa tesha yerefeen bi. Dey Intobaasik: «Intonaase! Naanees hanifewe» yi. <verse eid="JHN 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>Esseen orfo nawoosin: «Intone hanifawa» yi. Esseen orfo nawoos Maaraminon ephphe keeba hami. <verse eid="JHN 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>Estan Yesus zuuttambaase ko'inamato arifaat tichchera kuni bar ko'unak: «Iktengwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>Estak suqaro waynini usha tuumma diina koda faar. Waynini ushaason aka ephak chima wuzaassi haphqire i'ota<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I'oosi suna «husophi»</char></note> duusire noonobaassi tuchisete. <verse eid="JHN 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Yesus waynini ushaason suutire ushnayse: «Ko'iwa» yi. Estan teetbaason daa mugire kiti.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Teshaas Hebok Keche</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>Beysani wonaasi hooroni wona sinna boor'anawa es beysani wonaas dey akama heebo sinna boor'ana suuttere yere asusa dugno beysani wonaasik mesqeliista aane feeshfa. Es bari boor'a Ayhudni meeni ha'sinynyani meya suuttere yere baasso orgooson kiir'e kessusonek ajajonak Philaxosni shiiphsete. <verse eid="JHN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Estan meya taar'osakito yeesere Yesusneen ane suuttere yere tesuni basa orgonon kiir'esete. Tusire dey hepsaasa orgonon kiir'esete. <verse eid="JHN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Sinuntano Yesusniki yeesefe kabaasik bar kitinamato biyaat orgobaason aane kiir'oto. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Meya taar'osasin isaas teshbaason ebok kejin geregere harinnewa akane kesi. <verse eid="JHN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>Es baron biya bar nitto amanotik zaala make. Makena zaalaas dey futo. Makefena bar futo sinnamato bar arife. <verse eid="JHN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/>Es bar dey sinnaas: «Basa megaassin isarnu aafa kiitona wuza» yifa tichaasi kaama ko'unakwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/>Dey ooma tichaasnu: «Kejete barin biyonewa» yifa.<verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Dugnoosi Kabbarto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>Ayhudni ha'sinynyani meyanon digefaat aachok Yesusni nawo sina Armatiyaski Yosef Yesusni dugnooson ephanak Philaxosnin shiiphe. Pilatos dey ephanak make. Estan Yosef hamme dugnooson ephi. <verse eid="JHN 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/>Zeemo sinak talmak Yesuniki ye Nikodimos fayba keezasir kiilo sinni Kumbinewa Reettine woi'to sawa wuza ephphe ye. <verse eid="JHN 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>Yosefnawa Nikodimosna Yesusni dugnooson ephphe taamme Ayhudni meeni zuutuni tumaasimato shitto woshshire wor'a maamak kimete. <verse eid="JHN 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Bar suuttena dimaas toktera di akakiltiisi teshta. Es toktera di akakiltiisi ganesi asuni dugno girunoyna gaddo shu'ni mooga faar. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>Beysani wonaasi hooroni wona sinna boor'anawa moogaas dey ta'a sinna boor'ana Yesusni dugnooson esta kabbarsete.<verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Kitun Kabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>Guddani wono she'u feteetunoyfeen Megdelawitki Maarami moogaaski hami. Moogaasta uktera kuni inya shu'aas bukalera kunfeen bi. <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>Bar eelet Simon phexirosnikinawa Yesus shunfena oom nawooskina hamma: «Daamiisa dugnonon shu'ni moogaassin ephetewa. Ay kunussetemato aane aruweniwa» yi.<verse eid="JHN 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>Estan Phexiros oom nawoosna kesere moogaaski hamete. <verse eid="JHN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>Hepobesiise eelet hameter. Sinuntano oom nawoos Phexirosnistan taptere eelle zeemme moogaasi esta kar'i. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>Mogire biin Yesus kimtena maamaas kunfeen bi. Sinuntano sir aane giruwe. <verse eid="JHN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Simon Phexiros dey orfobaase yeere moogaassi girin kimtena maamaas kunfeen bi. <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>Dey teetbaasta marte maamaas kimte maamaasneen sinnoynaron teetbak birtera ooma dimta kunfeen bi. <verse eid="JHN 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>Estan dey zeemme moogaaski ye oom nawoos girire biire dey amane. <verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>«Bar kitun kabunak sholsifa» yifa tichaasi kaamanon hashnu aane yaadatosoto. <verse eid="JHN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Esseen orfo nawoni meya wolle feesefe dimaasta hamete.<verse eid="JHN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Megdelawitki Maaramik Beste</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>Megdelawitki Maarami moogaasi gerakalo yerefaat waasidifar. Waasifat moogaassi mogira bi. <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>Hep Ha'oni wosiya foro maya mayera Yesusni dugno kunnaasta isaas boktaasta isaas chogoosta diisefeen bi. <verse eid="JHN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>Baasso dey: «Han asuse! Awuni boor'a waasidifatarinse?» yisete. Bar wolgira: «Daamtaasa dugnonon ephphe hamete. Ay kunussetemato aane arut» yi. <verse eid="JHN 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>Es baron iyaat orfoba wolla biin Yesus yerefeen bi. Sinuntano bar sinbaason aane aruwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>Yesus: «Han asuse! Awuni boor'a waasidifatarinse? Oonininse sholedifatari?» yi. Bar akakiltini tasowa iyaat: «Daamiiso! Ne ephaatane ay kunsitamato makowa. Ta ephpha hamanawa» yi.<verse eid="JHN 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>Yesus baron: «Maaram» yi. Bar dey orfo wolla Ibrayistini noonok: «Rabuni» yi. Kotbaas dey: «Assinynyano» uu. <verse eid="JHN 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>Yesus: «Hashne den Abaaski aane hamut sinna boor'a taan ta'utaatawe. Sinuntano aytaasakitoniki hamfaat: ‹Ta abataaskinawa abantiisikna, Ha'onaaskinawa Ha'ontiiskina hamanar yi› yira makowe» yi. <verse eid="JHN 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>Estan Magdelawitki Maarami hamma nawoni meyak: «Daamiisin biingwa» yi. Dey bar barik awu makenamato baassok make.<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Nawobaasakitoneen Uphe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>Es guddani wono waalin nawoni meya Ayhudni meeni ha'sinynyani meyanon digesete boor'a gamalaasikitonon kulfaat zuuttesere feeseter. Yesus yeere baasso ganeyaassi yerefaat: «Naga nittok sinfawungwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>Es baron makefaat kushubaasewa teshbaase asin baassok besi. Nawoni meya dey daamiisin biyeteyse akamanon girsete. <verse eid="JHN 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>Yesus hepsa dey: «Naga nittok sinfawungwa. Abaas taan wosinaysimato ta dey nittotin wosunawa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>Es baron makefaat baassosta fugin: «Korto Ayyanaason ephpheteesete. <verse eid="JHN 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/>Nitto asuni meeni boor'aason feeshun iyaatine boor'besiis feeshun ustona. Nitto asuni meeni boor'aason feeshun uu shakaatine aafa feeshun ustona wuza» yi.<verse eid="JHN 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusnawa Tomasna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Es kabaasik asire heppesasin isaas; Didimoos<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«Didimos» uus Girikni noonok «Mano» uu. </char></note> yistefe Tomas Yesus yeena kabaasik baassoneen ane aafe. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Oom nawoni meya Tomasnik: «Daamiisin biiniwa» yisete. Sinuntano bar: «Musmarik ichche kushubaastaki sakaasson kushunaasi waay'ak sir zugera biinoynawa dey kushunaasi waay'ak teshbaastaki mazanon taptira biinoyna isanne aafa amanona wuza» yi. <verse eid="JHN 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Hepsa dey nangrinsinari wono<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hepsani Guddaasik </char></note> nawoni meya isarik feeseter. Tomas dey baassoneen ane feer. Gamalaasikito kuluftobaase feen Yesus yeere baasso ganeyaassi yerefaat: «Naga nittok sinfawungwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>Esseen orfo Tomasnin: «Kushuneesi waay'anon teshshera kushunaasi sakaasta ta'ira biwa. Kushuneeson teshshera teshnaastaki mazaason ta'uwa; amaner sintano amanonor sinatatawa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>Tomas dey: «Daamtaaso! Ha'onaase!» yire wolgi. <verse eid="JHN 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>Yesus dey Tomasnin: «Ne biita boor'atu amanetwa. Biinoy amanefe baasso suustowa» yi.<verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Han Matsafaas Awuni Boor'a Tichchenamato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>Yesus han tichaassi tichchonoy showo biistera artonoy wuza nawoni meyaneen ane feena kabaasik zagi. <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Sinuntano Yesus bar Kiristoos Ha'oosi Naa sinbaason amanotiknawa amanera dey basa sunaasik koi'ba foonto kaa danatiknatu han bar tichchewa.<verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Naafun Nawoni Meyak Beste</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>Esseen orfo Yesus Galiilaki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Galiilaki baarisi ooma suna «Tiberiyas».</char></note> baarisi tesha hepsa nawoni meyak ammanon beste. Es baassok ammanon bestenaas haniisimatowa. <verse eid="JHN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>Simon Phexirons, «Mano» yistefe Tomas, Galiilak fa Qaanani katamaassiki Naatinael, Zabdiyosni naanggotiisnawa nawobaasasin oom hep nawoosna isarik feeseter. <verse eid="JHN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/>Simon Phexiros baassok: «Kurxummni eshak hamnarwa» yi. Baasso dey: «Neneen ane hamaniwa» yisete. Kesere dey goonuussi girsete. Sinuntano es waalaasik isarinnu aane ephosoto. <verse eid="JHN 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>Wonfana kabaasik Yesus es baarisi ha'a yere. Sinuntano nawoni meya Yesus sinbaason aane arsoto. <verse eid="JHN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>Yesus: «Naanggotno! Isa eshsha ephti qurxummi faaroso?» yire mamsi. Baasso dey: «Aafawa» yire wolugsete. <verse eid="JHN 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>Bar dey: «Yugudooson goonuusi oi'ta teshta ha'utiwa; Estan danati» yi. Baasso dey ha'sete. Showo qurxummi ootte sinna boor'a zatte kisuk aane chimoto. <verse eid="JHN 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>Yesus shunfena nawoos Phexirosnin: «Daamiiswabiti!» yi. Es bari boor'a Simon Phexiros daamniis sinbaason odenayse atatubaase sinna boor'a maambaason mayye baariissi giri. <verse eid="JHN 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>Sinuntano oom nawoni meya daastan woketees isa tiya metiritano akamanon aane wokoto. Qurxummi tuumma fa yugudooson zatet goonuussi diisere yeesete. <verse eid="JHN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>Goonuussin kersefe kabaasik kurxummi barista kunna kaa'oni geenewa tushne biyete. <verse eid="JHN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>Yesus: «Hashti eshsha ephti kurxummiissin teshshotiwa» yi. <verse eid="JHN 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>Simon Phexiros goonuussi girire isa tiirewa uuchasire keeze inya inya qurxummik tuumma fa yugudooson zatte daasta kisi. Effatena showo sinfanaknu yugudoos aane karatowa. <verse eid="JHN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>Yesus baassotin: «Yaara ufeshshu muutiwa» yi. Daamiis bar sinbaason arsete boor'a nawoosasin isarnu: «Ne oonso?» yire mamsuk chimar aafe. <verse eid="JHN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>Yesus yeere tushaason ephphe baassok imaat kesse kurxummiison dey imi. <verse eid="JHN 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>Yesus kitun kabinanneen orfo nawoni meyak keessa wolle uphoba.<verse eid="JHN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Phexirosnin Mamsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>Ufeshshu meesetenneen orfo Yesus Simon Phexirosnin: «Yohanisni naa Simonno! Han baassostan denalo taan keeshtefatoso?» yire mamsi. Bar wolgire: «Aa, Daamtaaso! Shunfanamato ne aritarwa» yi. Yesus dey: «Garo garo fantunaason keemma» yi. <verse eid="JHN 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>Hepsa dey Yesus: «Yohannisni naa Simonno, taan keeshtefatoso?» yi. «Aa, Daamtaaso! Shunfanamato ne aritarwa» yi. Yesus wolgire: «Fantunaasikitonon keemma» yi. <verse eid="JHN 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>Keessak dey: «Yohannisni naa Simonno taan shunfa toso?» yi. Keessak dey: «Taan shunfa toso?» yina boor'a Phexiros suumere: «Daamtaaso! Ne zuuttambaase asin aritarwa. Shunfanamato dey ne aritarwa» yi. Yesus: «Fantunaasikitonon keemma. <verse eid="JHN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/>Futo neek makefangwa: Ne na'o asu sinfa ta kabaasik ne teetneesik geshoneeson talfak taar'era shunta dima hamet faatar. Sinuntano kur'ifata kabaasik kushuneeson kabgira besaan oom asu taatuna. Ne shunnoyta dima dey taamana» yi. <verse eid="JHN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>Yesus ekka yinaas Phexiros aro kitu kitire Ha'ooson ulfinsunamatotu besifa. Es baron iyaat: «Taneen ane hamniwa» yi.<verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusnawa Oom Nawoosna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>Phexiros yerqere Yesus shunfena nawobaas basa orfoose hamfeen bi. Es bar dey meeta'u maastefana kabaasik Yesusniki tai'sere: «Daamtaaso! Neen aatire imniis oonso?» yire mamsi barwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>Phexiros Yesus shunfena nawobaasin biyaat Yesusnin: «Han asus awu sinni?» yi. <verse eid="JHN 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>Yesus: «Ta wolla yoona kabaneen bar kaak foonak sholefaanane neen awu tiir'e. Ne taneen ane hamniwa!» yi. <verse eid="JHN 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Es bari boor'a nawoni meeni ganeyaassi: «Es nawoos aafa kituna wuza» yifa wolla zi'i. Sinuntano Yesus: «Ta wolla yoona kabaneen bar kaak foonak sholefaanane neen awu tiir'eso?» utu yiteno: «Aafa kituna wuza» aane uwe. <verse eid="JHN 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>Es nawoos han chowaasikitonon zuutire zaala makere tichiwa. Bar makena zaalaas futo sinnamato arifeni. <verse eid="JHN 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>Yesus zagina ooma showo wuza faar. Taak bestefanaysimato bar zagina wuzaas zuuttera isarba isarbaasik tichche sinfaanane es tichaason han daas teetbaasik wor'ak chimana kabatawa.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
